Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你好。我叫彼得·帕克。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hi. My name is Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.92,0:01:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不记得我了，但我有话跟你说
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.92,0:01:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't remember me, but I have something to tell you
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这话听着会很离谱。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that's gonna sound crazy.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.76,0:01:32.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可这是真的。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.76,0:01:32.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But it's the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且我知道你会相信我，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I know you're gonna believe me,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为你很擅长讲……
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}because you're very good at telling...
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.31,0:01:39.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-……我撒谎的时候。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.31,0:01:39.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-...when I'm lying.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}E.V.，帮我检查一下 我 的瞄准矩阵校准得对不对？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}E.V., can you check the calibration of my targeting matrix?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得还没抓准重点。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That doesn't feel zeroed in to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在检查目标校准。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Checking target calibration.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.74,0:01:57.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，E.V.，歇五分钟。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.74,0:01:57.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, E.V., take five.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}待命中。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Standing by.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们以前认识。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We used to know each other.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们当时在一起。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We were together.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可要出事了，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But something bad was gonna happen,
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.97,0:02:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而阻止它的唯一办法
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.97,0:02:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and the only way to stop it
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-是让所有人都忘了我。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-was to make everyone forget me.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MIT第一天，冲啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}First day at MIT, let's go!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪！我们到了！我们做到了！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my gosh! We're here! We made it!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，MJ，别这样。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, MJ, come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.81,0:02:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也包括你。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.81,0:02:28.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}lncluding you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}装作现在不是你这辈子最幸福的时候
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Pretend like you're not the happiest you've ever been
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在你这一生的此时此刻。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}in your entire life right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.78,0:02:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-! 做不到。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.78,0:02:33.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-! can't.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.94,0:02:35.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-咱们赶紧动手！  -好好好。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.94,0:02:35.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Let's just do this!   -Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.57,0:02:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你很开心！好吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.57,0:02:36.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're happy! Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为我不只是彼得·帕克。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Because I'm not just Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我真的，真的懂这种文化了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}'m really, really understanding the culture
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.79,0:02:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}波士顿这边就是很不一样。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.79,0:02:45.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}out here in Boston is just so different.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.33,0:02:48.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有时候，蜘蛛侠也得做艰难的事，
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.33,0:02:48.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And sometimes, Spider-Man has to do the hard thing,
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哪怕这会让彼得·帕克心碎。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}even if it breaks Peter Parker's heart.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这儿的人都说： “把 车停在港口边儿。”
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And everyone here is like, "Pahk the cah by the hahba."
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也许这就是我的责任。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And maybe that's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}独自带着真相活下去。
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}To live alone with the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.89,0:03:04.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可事实是，MJ，我爱你。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.89,0:03:04.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But the truth is, MJ, that I love you.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.94,0:03:07.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也希望，在内心深处，
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.94,0:03:07.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I hope that deep down,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.19,0:03:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你心底某处还记得，你也爱我。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.19,0:03:09.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}something inside of you remembers that you love me, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嫌犯身高5英尺8英寸、5英尺10英寸，中等身材。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Suspect is 5'8", 5'10", medium build.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但在那之前，我就只当蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But until then, I'm just gonna be Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.83,0:03:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.83,0:03:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Incoming!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嘿，抓住他！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey, get him!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，嘿，嘿。哇，哇，哇！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, hey, hey. Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Manfredi犯罪集团成员
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Members of the Manfredi crime syndicate
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}昨天被蜘蛛侠抓住了。
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}were apprehended by Spider-Man yesterday.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嘿，我们住同一层。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey, we live on the same floor.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。酷。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh. Cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人来过这儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Does anybody ever come up here?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}除非他们喜欢石棉。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Not unless they like asbestos.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.64,0:04:27.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们一直只拿它存东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.64,0:04:27.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We've just been using it for storage.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}太完美了。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.27,0:04:33.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，各位，高二的内德回来了。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.27,0:04:33.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, everyone, sophomore-year Ned is back.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}年纪更大，更睿智，更会飞。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Older, wiser, flyer.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-走吧！  -哇。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Let's go!   -Whoa.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你脸上是什么？ 你自己觉得呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What is on your face? How do you feel about it?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，你看着像个助理教练。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, you look like an assistant coach.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Huh.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你确定要这么干，蝎子？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You sure you wanna do this, Scorpion?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}想我了吗，小蜘蛛？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Did you miss me, Spidey?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是我把你从这儿扔下去，
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If I drop you from here,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你觉得你要多久才会落地？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}how long you think it will take you to hit the ground?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.43,0:05:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这个嘛，我也不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.43,0:05:04.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.35,0:05:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你说呢。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.35,0:05:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You tell me.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们来个漂亮收尾，怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's end this on a high note, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哟，Lonnie！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yo, Lonnie!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}发、发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wha ha happened?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}DeWolff，你要的全部证据
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}DeWolff, all the evidence you're gonna need
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在他车的后备厢里。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}is in the trunk of his car.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你想抢我饭碗啊，蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You tryin' to take my job, Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，你们才是专业的。 我只是个志愿者。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, you guys are the professionals, I'm just a volunteer.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.34,0:05:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是全新的纽约。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.34,0:05:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's a new New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.42,0:05:41.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}多亏蜘蛛侠， 犯罪率降到了历史最低。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.42,0:05:41.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks to Spider-Man, crime rates have dropped to a record low.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警方和损害控制局把大部分功劳归给
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Police and Damage Control give much of the credit
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.55,0:05:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}给那位蒙面英雄。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.55,0:05:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}to the masked hero.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}启动抬头显示测试。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Initiate HUD test.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.56,0:05:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}市民联合银行发生持械抢劫。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.56,0:05:48.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Armed robbery at Civic Union Bank.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.26,0:05:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}n过去六个月，他已经打倒了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.26,0:05:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}n the past six months, he has taken down
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.31,0:05:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}五大区的所有黑帮大佬，
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.31,0:05:53.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}every major crime lord across the five boroughs,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}包括有超能力的忍者组织手合会。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}including the superpowered ninja group The Hand.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.69,0:06:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他是纽约市的骄傲。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.69,0:06:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He is the pride of New York City.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.40,0:06:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}每个大人都依靠这位英雄， 每个孩子都想成为他。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.40,0:06:06.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The hero every grown-up relies on and every kid wants to be.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MIT，最后一学期。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Final semester, MIT.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪，再过一个月我们就毕业了。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my gosh, we're graduating in a month.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.91,0:06:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们留下了那么多回忆。从哪说起呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.91,0:06:16.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We've made so many memories. Where do I begin?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.21,0:06:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}和Jim、Wiley 在Charles River夜泳。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.21,0:06:19.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Night swimming in the Charles River with Jim and Wiley.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Banana Lounge那场 臭名昭著的食物大战。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The infamous food fight at the Banana Lounge.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.34,0:06:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}和MJ、Nate Dawg 在Stud 5熬通宵。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.34,0:06:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Pulling all-nighters in Stud with MJ and Nate Dawg.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}感觉就像昨天， 我还和MJ坐在屋顶上，
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It feels like yesterday I was sitting on a roof with MJ,
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.56,0:06:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}梦想着能一起来这儿， 真不敢信我们做到了。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.56,0:06:32.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}dreaming about coming here together, and I still can't believe we did it.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我很感激我结交的每一位朋友。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm so grateful for all the friends that I've made.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:35.77,0:06:38.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我无法想象和别人一起经历这一切。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.77,0:06:38.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I couldn't imagine going through this with anyone else.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.19,0:06:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}内德，你觉得谁真会看这些？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.19,0:06:40.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ned, who do you think is actually watching these?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.53,0:06:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-但也许有人。好吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.53,0:06:42.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-But maybe someone. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，那再见了，某人。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, well, bye, someone.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？再见。我们完了。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What? Bye. We're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不！对，我们结束了。
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No! Yeah, we're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.47,0:07:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，那可是布鲁克林 市中心， 还是大白天。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.47,0:07:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, we're talking about downtown Brooklyn in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那么轰动的一票， 你知道Foswell有 份。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}High-profile job like that, you know that Foswell was involved.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，我懂，可你能证明吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I hear you, but can you prove it?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，我在查他的财务记录
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I'm going through his financial records
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我每晚还跟踪他那帮人。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and I'm following his crew every night.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}除了工作，你还干别的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you do anything besides work?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道那句话吧，"做你喜欢的事，
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know the saying, "You do something you love,
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.23,0:07:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}"你这辈子一天活都不用干。"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.23,0:07:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}"you don't work a day in your life."
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-妈，我的计算器呢？  -不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Mom, where's my calculator?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.15,0:07:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}信我，行吗？ 一心扑在 工作上，准没好下场。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.15,0:07:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Trust me, aight? Being married to the job never ends well.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好啦，别担心。我会没事的。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, don't worry about it. I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，是吗？可你还头疼吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah? You still getting them headaches, though?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，是啊。可，嗯……可我会没事的。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, yeah. But, um... But I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，我也不知道，哥们。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mmm, I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看你的身体想跟你说点什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think your body's tryin' to tell you somethin'.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你偶尔也得脱下那身战衣。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like you need to get outta that suit every once in a while.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}妈，你知道我的计算器在哪吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mom, do you know where my calculator is?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道，老爸。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know, Papi.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你需要的是真心的人际交流。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What you need is some real human connection.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊？什么？我们没联系上？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, what? And we're not connecting?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.72,0:07:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不是，哥们。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.72,0:07:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Nah, dude.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道你叫什么， 不知道你长什么样， 对你一无所知。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know your name, your face, or nothing about you.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得你从没问过我的生活。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't think you've ever asked me a question about my life.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.98,0:08:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}当然有。
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.98,0:08:00.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sure, I have.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那我的孩子都叫什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, what are my kids' names?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，先说一点，你儿子叫Papi。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, well, for starters, your son's name's Papi.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.82,0:08:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是蜘蛛侠吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.82,0:08:07.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is it Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}亲爱的，这我不能告诉你。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't tell you that, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那就是说，是蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That means it's Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Gosh.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.70,0:08:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一辆被劫的坦克正向南驶过34街。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.70,0:08:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A hijacked tank is heading southbound past 34th Street.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.71,0:08:20.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所有空闲单位立即出动。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.71,0:08:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All available units respond.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.46,0:08:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}喂，你收到了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.46,0:08:21.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, you getting this?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}活儿又多了。你可真走运。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}More work. Lucky you.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，外面见。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, I'll see you out there.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真对不起，我得走了。
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm so sorry, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呜呼！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoo!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗷呜！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Awoo!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.86,0:09:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.86,0:09:32.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我接住你了，小蜘蛛！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got you, Spidey!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不。我不需要你的……
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, no. I don't need your...
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇。
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿！小心！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey! Heads up!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事吧，孩子？嗯，你没事。回头见。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You okay, kid? Yeah, you're okay. See ya later.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}光看外表，你可看不出来，
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You wouldn't know it just by looking at it,
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.45,0:10:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可就是这条街 在纽约 大战中被彻底摧毁了。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.45,0:10:16.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but this very street was completely destroyed in the Battle of New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点，快点，快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，天哪。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嘿。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞什么，弗兰克？ 你 刚开面包车撞了我！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The hell, Frank? You just hit me with the van!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.70,0:10:58.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别哼哼唧唧了。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.70,0:10:58.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Quit your whimpering.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们不会再那么干了，弗兰克。
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're not doing that again, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你他妈说得对，我们不是。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're goddamn right we're not.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这次你他妈给我让开。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This time you're gonna get the hell outta my way.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，你是说不该救你的命？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, you mean instead of saving your life?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:06.00,0:11:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，你又要扯斯塔滕岛那破事？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.00,0:11:09.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Eh, you gonna talk about that Staten Island bullshit again?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊，这可是你说的，不是我。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ah, well, you said it, not me.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:11.09,0:11:12.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.09,0:11:12.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jeez.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.17,0:11:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，兄弟，你不能啥事都靠开枪。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.17,0:11:14.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, man, you can't just shoot yourself out of every situation.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}无辜的人会受伤。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Innocent people get hurt.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.68,0:11:17.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为那坦克炮口对着谁，蠢货？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.68,0:11:17.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who do you think's downrange of that tank, dumb-dumb?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}随你便。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蠢货。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jackass.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这该死的家伙。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This freakin' guy.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-他妈……
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Motherf...
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}回家去，弗兰克！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Go home, Frank!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要杀了这小子。
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna kill this kid.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}DeWolff？ -你到底拦不拦那东西？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-DeWolff?   -Are you gonna stop that thing or what?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它正直奔损害控制局拘留中心。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's heading straight for the Damage Control Detention Center.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.72,0:12:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我在努力。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.72,0:12:05.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.81,0:12:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再加把劲。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.81,0:12:06.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Try harder.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.94,0:12:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那里面关着不少吓人的家伙。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.94,0:12:08.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There's a lot of scary dudes locked up in there.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.77,0:12:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你以为是谁把他们放进去的？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.77,0:12:10.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, who do you think put them in there?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}走吧，蝎子。该搬家了。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's go, Scorpion. Moving day.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}拜托！马上撤离！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please! Evac now!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，所有人，快离开！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right, everybody, clear out!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这家伙有武器，很危险。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This guy is armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……女士，下车。
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh... Get out of the vehicle, ma'am.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也是这么想的。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where am I?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么鬼……
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the...
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快走！快走！快走！快走！快走！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Move! Move! Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}留下她审问。清空大楼。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Keep her for questioning. Clear the building.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}兜风愉快，蝎子！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Enjoy the ride, Scorpion!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}进了超级戒备监狱，你就难见天日了。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You won't be seeing much daylight in Supermax.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.53,0:13:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们，蝎子都是夜里活动的。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.53,0:13:41.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Scorpions are nocturnal, buddy.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这栋楼正遭到袭击。
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The building is under attack.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}马上把囚犯带走！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get the prisoner out of here now!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}长官！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sir!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得马上离开！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You gotta take off now!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}大楼被攻破了！快！快！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The building has been breached. Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，发动起来！走！走！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, fire it up! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}计划有变！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Change of plans!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}带他去Bellevu e的直升机停机坪。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Take him to the helipad at Bellevue.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.25,0:14:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-什么？  -这是命令
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.25,0:14:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What?   -That's an order
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}梅茨格主任下的命令。 快！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}from Director Metzger. Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.54,0:14:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就现在！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.54,0:14:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}收到。
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Copy that.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿！什么……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey! What...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我怎么上来的？呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-How did I get up here? Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠，救救我，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man, save me, would you?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:04.86,0:15:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是谁？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.86,0:15:05.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能看见我。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You can see me.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.66,0:15:09.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}告诉我你是谁。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.66,0:15:09.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你先。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You first.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。嘿。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你把我推了出去。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You pushed me out.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Interesting.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}刚才那是什么鬼？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:28.18,0:15:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你刚才想闯进我的脑子？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.18,0:15:30.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Did you just try to jump into my mind?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，你追我的这整段时间，
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, the whole time you've been chasing me,
Dialogue: 2,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你忘了问自己一个很重要的问题。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}you forgot to ask yourself a very important question.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:38.73,0:15:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}罐子里装的什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.73,0:15:40.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's in the tank?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:41.98,0:15:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快！动起来。
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.98,0:15:43.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Go! Move.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.75,0:15:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.75,0:15:58.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-刚才怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What just happened?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:04.09,0:16:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.09,0:16:05.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，干得不错。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, good job.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:08.38,0:16:09.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，干得漂亮，蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.38,0:16:09.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, way to go, Spidey.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你们没事吧？还好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You guys okay? You good?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.34,0:16:14.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我发誓。 他们说我干的那些 事， 我一件都不记得干过。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.34,0:16:14.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I swear. All the things they said I did, I don't remember doing any of them.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，没事。 听我说， 让这些人好好照顾你。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay, it's okay. Look, let these people take good care of you.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我绝不会伤害你。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I would never hurt you.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。-我爱你，蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Okay.   -I love you, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。好，伙计。好。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. All right, buddy. All right.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嘿，你拿的什么？  -给，拿着。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey, what do you got?   -Here, get this.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}直升机把蝎子送去了Bellevue。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Chopper took Scorpion to Bellevue.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}十分钟后，一名警卫就把他带出了门。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ten minutes later, a guard walked him right out the door.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？嗯哼。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What? Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那坦克呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What about the tank?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}从布鲁克林损害控制局仓库偷的。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stolen from the Damage Control warehouse in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}司机以前在那儿当清洁工。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Driver was a janitor who worked there.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你有动机吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You got a motive?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么都没有。也没有犯罪记录。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.54,0:16:37.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Nada. And no criminal record.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蝎子肯定想办法对她下手了。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Scorpion must've gotten to her somehow.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，也许吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. Maybe.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}“也许”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean, "maybe"?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，我……我不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但我认识一个可能知道的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But I know someone that might.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你去哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where you going?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你继续追查蝎子的线索。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You keep following the leads on Scorpion.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我去找个人聊聊。
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna go talk to someone.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.57,0:17:12.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨，呃，是布莱顿海滩3250号吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.57,0:17:12.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hi, uh, is this 3250 Brighton Beach?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:18.54,0:17:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想我知道那是什么意思了。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.54,0:17:20.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think I know what that means.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把衣服脱了。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, what?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蒸汽浴里不穿衣服。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't wear clothes in the banya.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把紧身衣脱了。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ditch the leotard.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这不是连体紧身衣。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is not a leotard.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你短信里说这是你的办公室。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Your text said that this was your office.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.23,0:17:43.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是我的办公室。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.23,0:17:43.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is my office.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-进来。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Get in.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，我没事，谢谢。我就……
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, I'm fine, thanks. I'll just...
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.28,0:17:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇哇。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.28,0:17:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wah-wah.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的办公室，我说了算。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My office, my rules.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样，你就能舒舒服服泡个澡，
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This way, you get to enjoy a nice, relaxing soak,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也能确认你没带任何武器，
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and I get to see that you don't have any weapons,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱俩就都赢了。
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and we both win.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.96,0:18:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的？怎么，你从来不脱下来？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.96,0:18:13.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Really? What, you never take that off?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，我……你知道， 这样还怎么匿名啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, I... You know, it defeats the whole anonymous thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.80,0:18:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哪怕是你女朋友、男朋友什么的？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.80,0:18:20.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Even for your girlfriend or boyfriend or whatever?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}网上有很多猜测。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There's a lot of conjecture online.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有超露骨的画作。 你看过吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And super graphic artwork. Have you seen?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:26.10,0:18:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你和十个神秘客那张，真是……
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.10,0:18:28.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The one with you and the ten Mysterios, it's...
Dialogue: 2,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我……我……我见过它。我……
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've... I've... I've seen it. I've...
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说真的，看了就很难当没看过。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's hard to unsee, to be honest.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可你看，我身边谁也没有。 我就总是一个人待着。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But, look, I don't have anyone. I just kinda keep to myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一直都只有你一个人？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All by yourself? All the time?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}难怪你这么难过。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No wonder you're so sad.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我没那么难过。  -有一点。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm not so sad.   -A little bit.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咱们能不能就聊聊 我来找你要说的事，
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Could we just talk about what I came here to talk to you about,
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}袭击损害控制局的事？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}the attack on Damage Control?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:44.58,0:18:48.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。那就更是你的专长了。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.58,0:18:48.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yes. So, that is more your area.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:49.21,0:18:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就是些鸡毛蒜皮的小事。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.21,0:18:51.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like, small potato stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.21,0:18:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}新复仇者联盟则专心干大事。
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.21,0:18:58.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whereas the New Avengers are focusing on big potato stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:59.35,0:19:02.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，好吧。 不过， 不光是这样。 你知道， 就是，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.35,0:19:02.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right, okay. Well, there's more to it than that, you Know, the, uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.56,0:19:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……司机和其他帮忙的人，
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.56,0:19:06.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}...the driver and the others who were helping,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就像有人在通过它们跟我说话。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}it was like someone was talking to me through them.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就像有人透过他们的眼睛看着我。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like someone was looking at me through their eyes.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你在想，会不会是精神控制？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you're wondering if it's mind control?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.49,0:19:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-没错。  -就像他们在 红房子 对我用的那样？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.49,0:19:16.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Exactly.   -Like how they used on me in the Red Room?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-没错。  -其他寡妇呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Exactly.   -And the other widows?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.86,0:19:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-对。  -对。不，我不这么想。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.86,0:19:19.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Right.   -Right. No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.91,0:19:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我倒觉得，这可能更像是附身。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.91,0:19:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I actually think it's probably more like possession.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}附身？-嗯。嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Possession?   -Hmm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}像幽灵或恶魔一样。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like a ghost or a demon.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。 -我们俄罗斯还有林妖。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, man.   -Or in Russia, we have leshy.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:30.75,0:19:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Leshy统治森林，还能附身……
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.75,0:19:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Leshy rules the forest and can possess...
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不管是什么，他们都在找东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whatever it is, they are looking for something.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这已是灾害控制局设施 本月第四次遭袭。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is the fourth attack on the Damage Control facility this month.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你觉得他们在找什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And what do you think they're looking for?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:46.60,0:19:47.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.60,0:19:47.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But you know what?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}今天遇袭后，
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}After the attack today,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:51.65,0:19:55.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}触发了跨机构网络安全警报。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.65,0:19:55.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}there was a cross-agency cybersecurity alert that got triggered.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:56.07,0:19:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人访问了损害控制局的 受限服务器
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.07,0:19:59.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Someone accessed the Damage Control restricted servers
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.53,0:20:02.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}用中转站30名员工的身份凭证。
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.53,0:20:02.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}using credentials from employees from the way station.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们都在找同一样东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They all searched for the same thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.75,0:20:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}V-Max.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.75,0:20:07.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}V-Max.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}V-Max.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}V-Max.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:13.55,0:20:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，这可能是外星科技，
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.55,0:20:16.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, it could be alien tech,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:16.38,0:20:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}或是秘密武器计划，
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.38,0:20:20.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}or secretive weapon programs,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}或是发射密码，或是……
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}or launch codes or...
Dialogue: 2,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道，这得你来搞清楚。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know, this is for you to figure out.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这都是小事，小土豆级别的……
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is small, baby potato stuff...
Dialogue: 2,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，好。-……不是大土豆脑的活。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Okay, okay.   -...not big potato brain stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不用喊那么大声。真是的。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't have to shout about it. Jeez.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要不我自己去问损害控制局。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe I'll just go ask Damage Control myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:36.44,0:20:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，你已经不算完全匿名了。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.44,0:20:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, you're not completely anonymous anymore.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我见过你的肚脐。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've seen your belly button.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。再见。
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你好，我约了，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hi, I got an appointment with, uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}梅茨格导演。对。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Director Metzger. Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请通过扫描仪。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please step through the scanner.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}检测到强化人类。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Enhanced human detected.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}超强力量。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Superior strength.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}超强的敏捷性。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Superior agility.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}感官更敏锐。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Heightened senses.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.87,0:21:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}外源DNA。蛛形纲动物。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.87,0:21:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Exogenous DNA. Arachnid.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请摘下面罩，进行身份扫描。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please remove your face covering for identity scan.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，不，我做不到。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, no, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-不可能。  -未摘下面罩
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-That's not possible.   -Failure to remove your face covering
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}将触发防御措施。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}will result in defensive measures.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}防御措施？你在说什……
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Defensive measures? What are you talk...
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇，哇，哇。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.38,0:21:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}各位，各位，各位！ 我不能摘面罩。我……
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.38,0:21:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Guys, guys, guys! I can't take my mask off. I'm...
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:46.93,0:21:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-他没事。放松。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.93,0:21:49.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-He's all right. At ease.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My apologies.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能来，我们太高兴了。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We are so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.27,0:21:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Bill Metzger， 损害控制局局长。 你好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.27,0:21:59.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Bill Metzger, Director of Damage Control. How are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我挺好的，谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm good, thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.57,0:22:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们这儿加强了安保，没吓着你吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.57,0:22:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We had to beef up security around here, but I hope we didn't give you a fright.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，一点也不是。-好，来吧。走这边。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No, not at all.   -All right, come on. This way.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:08.16,0:22:10.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这层主要是研究和行政部门。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.16,0:22:10.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This floor is mostly research and administrative.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.04,0:22:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}楼下有事故清理、 实验室和特工训练。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.04,0:22:14.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Downstairs, we have incident cleanup, laboratories, agent training.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.62,0:22:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.62,0:22:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嘿，他们来这儿干吗？  -没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey, what are they doing here?   -It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}手合会现在给我们办事。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The Hand works for us now.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你把他们带来后，我才意识到
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}After you brought them in, I realized that
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说到底，他们就是一群 没领头人的孩子。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}fundamentally, they're a group of kids without a leader.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们只需要一点指引。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All they needed was a little direction.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后突然间，让他们变得危险的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Then, suddenly, all the things that made them dangerous
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.22,0:22:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}让他们成了我们安保团队的 无价之宝。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.22,0:22:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}turned them into an invaluable part of our security team.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:37.27,0:22:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}面对重重威胁， 你可能只看到危险。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.27,0:22:40.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You can look at the many threats that face us and see only danger.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}或者，你也能看到机会。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Or you can see opportunity.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，好吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.99,0:22:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇，快看那个。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.99,0:22:51.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wow, look at that.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.08,0:22:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这些东西在惊悚手里很烦人。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.08,0:22:54.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}In the hands of Shocker, these are a nuisance.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但我们照样能借鉴这项技术，
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But it doesn't mean we can't learn from the technology,
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.25,0:22:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}或者尊重创新。
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.25,0:22:59.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}or respect the innovation.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.63,0:23:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们的任务是把破坏性的 能量 用到有益的地方。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.63,0:23:04.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Our mission is to redirect destructive energy into something useful.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这才是损害控制局的真正含义。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's the true meaning of Damage Control.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.76,0:23:12.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心点，别弄坏了。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.76,0:23:12.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Be careful with that.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.89,0:23:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这边请。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.89,0:23:14.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right this way.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我，呃……我想跟你聊聊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I, uh... I wanted to talk to you
Dialogue: 2,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}关于最近针对该机构的袭击。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}about the recent attacks on the agency.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}已经有四个了，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There's been four, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.82,0:23:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请坐。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.82,0:23:24.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.03,0:23:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你说得对。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.03,0:23:27.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You are right.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.95,0:23:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看来我们遇上了控制不了的威胁。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.95,0:23:30.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It appears we're faced with a threat we can't control.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一个我们根本看不见的。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}One we can't even see.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但你可以。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But you can.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:36.96,0:23:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看过监控录像了。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.96,0:23:38.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I saw the security footage.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也看了DeWolff警探的报告。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I also read Detective DeWolff's report.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.21,0:23:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我相信你很清楚我们面对的是什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.21,0:23:45.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I believe you understand exactly what we're up against.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.72,0:23:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}能钻进别人脑子的人或东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.72,0:23:49.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Someone or something that can hop into people's minds.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:50.55,0:23:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但不是你的。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.55,0:23:51.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But not yours.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:51.64,0:23:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，我是说，它试过，但没成功。
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.64,0:23:54.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, I mean, it tried, but it couldn't.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:03.52,0:24:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我就跟你说实话吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.52,0:24:05.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna be honest with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:05.94,0:24:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们现在被压着打。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:05.94,0:24:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're on our heels right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它要是进来， 找到它要找 的东西， 那可就糟了，
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}God forbid if it were to get in here and find whatever it is it's looking for,
Dialogue: 2,0:24:11.28,0:24:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}后果可能不堪设想。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:11.28,0:24:15.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}the consequences could be unimaginable.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:17.79,0:24:19.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，让我猜猜，它要找的是不是
Dialogue: 1,0:24:17.79,0:24:19.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, let me guess, is whatever it's looking for
Dialogue: 2,0:24:19.62,0:24:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在那个大金库里？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.62,0:24:20.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}in that giant vault?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.71,0:24:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有些事，因为我的工作性质
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.71,0:24:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There are some things, because of the nature of my job
Dialogue: 2,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不能告诉你。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I cannot tell you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:27.80,0:24:30.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但我相信 你是我们抵 御这一切的最强防线
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.80,0:24:30.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But I believe you are our best defense against this.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只有你能感觉到。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're the only one who can sense it.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是唯一对它免疫的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're the only one who's immune to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}打败它就靠你了。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm counting on you to defeat it.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.90,0:24:41.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这番演讲挺不错，局长。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.90,0:24:41.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's a pretty good speech, Director.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:42.73,0:24:44.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我保证，我会尽我所能。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.73,0:24:44.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll do everything that I can, I promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:45.90,0:24:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，那你就是损害控制局的朋友了。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.90,0:24:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, then consider yourself a friend of Damage Control.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:50.24,0:24:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我会联系你的。
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.24,0:24:51.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.57,0:24:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。呃，我想问，嗯……
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.57,0:24:54.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh. Uh, I wanted to ask, um...
Dialogue: 2,0:24:55.54,0:24:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不知道"V-Max"是啥，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.54,0:24:58.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}the phrase "V-Max" doesn't mean anything to you, does it?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:59.62,0:25:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没有。你听谁说的？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:59.62,0:25:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. Where'd you hear that?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:02.50,0:25:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，就是，你懂的， 当超级英雄都这样，
Dialogue: 1,0:25:02.50,0:25:05.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, it's just, you know, nature of being a superhero,
Dialogue: 2,0:25:05.42,0:25:06.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有些事我真不能告诉你。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.42,0:25:06.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}there are some things I just can't tell ya.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:08.09,0:25:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那就回头见。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.09,0:25:09.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Anyway, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你们做得很棒，继续加油。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You guys are doing great. Keep it up.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:12.34,0:25:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看Metzger知 道的也不比我们多，
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.34,0:25:14.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't think Metzger knows any more than we do,
Dialogue: 2,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但我跟他说了，我会尽力帮忙。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but I told him I'd do whatever I can to help.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.64,0:25:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你想帮忙？你能做的最有用的事
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.64,0:25:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You wanna help? The best thing you could do
Dialogue: 2,0:25:19.10,0:25:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就是找到蝎子。 他是我们唯一的线索。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.10,0:25:21.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}is find Scorpion. He's our only lead.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:21.31,0:25:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，我知道。全城摄像头我都有
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.31,0:25:23.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I know. I have every camera in the city
Dialogue: 2,0:25:23.19,0:25:25.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在用人脸识别扫描找他。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:23.19,0:25:25.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}running a facial recognition scan for him.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这听着太违法了， 蜘蛛侠。 我就当没听 见。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That sounds super illegal, Spider-Man. I'mma pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:28.99,0:25:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，这样大概最好。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.99,0:25:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, probably for the best.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:30.45,0:25:31.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过听着，他只要露面， 我们就会知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.45,0:25:31.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But look, if he shows his face, we'll know.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:31.99,0:25:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你们有迷你啤酒桶吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.99,0:25:33.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you have any mini-kegs?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:34.28,0:25:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在那边尽头。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.28,0:25:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Down at the end.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢了。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:39.79,0:25:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我回头打给你。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.79,0:25:40.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:43.12,0:25:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-啊哈。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.12,0:25:45.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Aha.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:45.96,0:25:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}放轻松。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.96,0:25:46.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Easy.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:51.13,0:25:54.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，呃，对了，有Sharkfire Energy吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.13,0:25:54.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, uh, also, you got any Sharkfire Energy?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.64,0:25:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.64,0:25:56.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:57.18,0:25:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，不，不，不。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.18,0:25:58.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:58.56,0:26:00.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不要。那玩意儿会害死你。
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.56,0:26:00.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't want any. That stuff will kill you.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，期末考试那阵 子 我朋友们都在喝那个
Dialogue: 1,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, all my friends were drinking them during finals
Dialogue: 2,0:26:02.48,0:26:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在他们上瘾了。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:02.48,0:26:03.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and now they're addicted.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.73,0:26:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以我得请你一点也别卖给我。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.73,0:26:06.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And so I'm gonna need you to not sell me any.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:06.82,0:26:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}记住我的脸。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.82,0:26:07.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Memorize my face.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.15,0:26:12.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请别卖给这家伙任何S harkfire。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.15,0:26:12.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please do not sell this guy any Sharkfire.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:13.57,0:26:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行吧，随便。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:13.57,0:26:14.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sure. Whatever.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}算了，给我一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Actually, I'll take one.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}最后一个。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Last one.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.91,0:26:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可能两个。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.91,0:26:20.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe two.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:20.37,0:26:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那以后一点都别卖给我。
Dialogue: 1,0:26:20.37,0:26:22.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And then never sell me any.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:24.08,0:26:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}该死
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.08,0:26:26.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Damn it.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，内德！
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yo, Ned!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:00.54,0:27:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-啊，什么？内德！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:00.54,0:27:01.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, what? Ned!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-给我。  -哦，哥们，谢了。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Give me that.   -Oh, my guy, appreciate you.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:03.62,0:27:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-走吧！  -好啊，哥们。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.62,0:27:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Let's go!   -Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.25,0:27:06.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}走吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.25,0:27:06.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's go!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:40.87,0:27:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得喝一杯。 拿着这 个，拿着这个，拿着。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.87,0:27:43.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You need a drink. Take this, take this, take it.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:43.62,0:27:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢了。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.62,0:27:44.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:47.79,0:27:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不好意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:27:47.79,0:27:48.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:32.46,0:28:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:32.46,0:28:33.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦。呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh. Um...
Dialogue: 2,0:28:36.38,0:28:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看来你无意间逛到我的看板了。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.38,0:28:39.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}See you've stumbled across my board.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:39.26,0:28:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我发誓，我不是那种怪人。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:39.26,0:28:40.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not one of those weirdos, I swear.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:41.34,0:28:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我上高中那会儿， 他其实救过我和朋友们好几 次命。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:41.34,0:28:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He actually saved me and my friends' lives a few times in high school.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:44.85,0:28:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哦，真酷。对，对。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.85,0:28:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, cool. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:46.72,0:28:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}从那以后，我就一直想弄清他是谁。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:46.72,0:28:49.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And ever since, I've just been trying to figure out who he is.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:49.39,0:28:53.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不是要向全世界公开他的身份， 就是想知道他是谁，懂吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:49.39,0:28:53.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Not to unmask him to the world or anything, just to know, you know?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:53.69,0:28:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也希望能当面谢谢他。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:53.69,0:28:55.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And to, hopefully, thank him face to face.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:58.49,0:29:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}其实我做了这个应用， 能追踪他的现身消息。
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.49,0:29:01.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I actually created this app that monitors his sightings.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:02.16,0:29:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，Spidey Tracker是你做的？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:02.16,0:29:03.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, you created Spidey Tracker?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你听说过？不错。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You heard of it? Nice.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:06.74,0:29:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:06.74,0:29:08.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where is Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:08.12,0:29:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那边有个小聊天室。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:08.12,0:29:10.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Little chat room right there.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:10.29,0:29:12.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在我们知道，他肯定来自皇后区。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:10.29,0:29:12.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, we know he's definitely from Queens.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:12.88,0:29:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也不算什么惊人消息。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:12.88,0:29:14.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Not the biggest revelation.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:14.59,0:29:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过我已把范围缩小到 两名头号嫌疑人。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.59,0:29:19.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But I have been able to narrow it down to two prime suspects.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:23.22,0:29:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，你要是知道他们是谁，准惊掉下巴。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.22,0:29:26.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, if you knew who they were, it would really blow your mind.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我确定。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:28.39,0:29:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对了，我叫内德。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.39,0:29:29.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ned, by the way.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:30.31,0:29:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，我，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:29:30.31,0:29:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, I'm, um...
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.52,0:29:33.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊，我们公寓里得有50个人。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.52,0:29:33.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}God, there's, like, people in our apartment.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:34.02,0:29:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}统计上看， 他们中至少 有两个是反社会人格者，
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.02,0:29:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Statistically speaking, that means at least two of them are sociopaths,
Dialogue: 2,0:29:37.28,0:29:39.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这还挺酷的。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.28,0:29:39.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-which is kind of cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:41.61,0:29:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}花真漂亮。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:41.61,0:29:42.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Nice flowers.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:43.82,0:29:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，这些是，呃，乔迁礼物。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.82,0:29:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, they're, uh, a housewarming gift.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:47.24,0:29:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的？-对。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.24,0:29:48.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Really?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，好吧。 大多数人 只带了啤酒和薯片。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, okay. Most people just brought beer and chips.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:51.21,0:29:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那可真不错。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.21,0:29:52.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's very nice.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:52.50,0:29:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，我是MJ。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.50,0:29:53.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, I'm MJ.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:54.67,0:29:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我，呃……我，呃，叫Maynard。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:54.67,0:29:58.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm, uh... I'm, uh, Maynard.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:59.01,0:30:00.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，Maynard。
Dialogue: 1,0:29:59.01,0:30:00.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, Maynard.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，你们俩不认识？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, you two don't know each other?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:03.59,0:30:05.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，不是，我是邻居。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:03.59,0:30:05.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, no, I'm a neighbor.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:05.64,0:30:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，友好的邻居。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:05.64,0:30:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm, friendly neighbor.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:10.52,0:30:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:10.52,0:30:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:12.14,0:30:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}面试怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.14,0:30:13.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So, how was the interview?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:14.35,0:30:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我去把这些放水里。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:14.35,0:30:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna go put these in water.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}很高兴认识你， Maynard。 书 呆子。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It was nice to meet you, Maynard. Nerd.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.94,0:30:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}梅纳德。对。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.94,0:30:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maynard. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}借过，不好意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Excuse me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:21.36,0:30:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你去了没？快说你去了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:21.36,0:30:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Did you go? Please tell me that you went.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，不，我去了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. No, I went.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:25.45,0:30:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.45,0:30:26.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.99,0:30:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且，我拿到那份工作了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.99,0:30:28.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I got the job.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:28.20,0:30:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪，MJ，太棒了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.20,0:30:30.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God, MJ, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:30.41,0:30:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我拒绝了。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.41,0:30:32.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I turned it down.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:32.29,0:30:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:32.29,0:30:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:33.54,0:30:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，我不想给没人性的公司打工。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:33.54,0:30:35.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. I don't wanna work for some soulless corporation.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们不全都没灵魂。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They're not all soulless.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:39.76,0:30:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧。他们基本都没灵魂。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:39.76,0:30:41.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. They're all mostly soulless.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:41.72,0:30:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可你不想要医保啥的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.72,0:30:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But don't you want, like, health insurance?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:43.68,0:30:45.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，我当然想。可代价呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.68,0:30:45.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, of course I do. But at what cost?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:46.01,0:30:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那得看你的免赔额。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.01,0:30:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Depends on your deductible.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.72,0:30:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，你是说你的原则之类的？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.72,0:30:50.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, you mean, like, your principles?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.52,0:30:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。 -抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.52,0:30:51.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Yes.   -Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:51.68,0:30:53.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。我知道听着挺俗套，
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.68,0:30:53.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know. I Know it sounds cheesy,
Dialogue: 2,0:30:53.10,0:30:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可我就是有种感觉
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.10,0:30:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but something is just telling me
Dialogue: 2,0:30:55.52,0:30:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说我该等着好事发生，你懂吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:55.52,0:30:59.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that I'm supposed to be waiting for something great, you know?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:00.23,0:31:01.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，呃，
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.23,0:31:01.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Well, um,
Dialogue: 2,0:31:01.98,0:31:04.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}去，呃，等着美好的事发生。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:01.98,0:31:04.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}to, uh, waiting for something great.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:04.78,0:31:06.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为等待美好到来干杯。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:04.78,0:31:06.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}To waiting for something great.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:06.57,0:31:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，终于等到了。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.57,0:31:08.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, the wait is over.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:08.78,0:31:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-糟了。  -去你的新家。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.78,0:31:10.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Uh-oh.   -To your new home.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哥们，这可是顶级货。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dude, this is top-shelf.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:12.29,0:31:13.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就像你一样。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.29,0:31:13.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just like you.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:13.41,0:31:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊！——啊！伙计。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.41,0:31:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Aw!   -Aw! Dude.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:16.71,0:31:18.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我要把这个藏起来。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.71,0:31:18.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm gonna hide this.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:20.13,0:31:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我又从他身上顺走了这个。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.13,0:31:21.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I lifted this off of him again.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:23.42,0:31:26.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可内德要是需要一千条鲨鱼的火呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.42,0:31:26.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But what if Ned needs the fire of a thousand sharks?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:26.13,0:31:28.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你是说心悸？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.13,0:31:28.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You mean heart palpitations?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:29.47,0:31:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你救不了所有人。  -我可以试试。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.47,0:31:31.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You can't save everyone.   -I can try.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:33.72,0:31:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这才是我的好姑娘。
Dialogue: 1,0:31:33.72,0:31:34.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.37,0:31:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起，我得……
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.37,0:31:52.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry. I gotta...
Dialogue: 2,0:32:13.52,0:32:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等我们考上MIT，就一起住吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:13.52,0:32:16.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}When we get into MIT, we should live together.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:17.06,0:32:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，当然。嗯，我很乐意。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.06,0:32:18.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, for sure. Yeah, I'd love that.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:19.35,0:32:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}成为全新的开始。 我们也都会在一起。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:19.35,0:32:22.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Be a fresh start. And we'll all be together.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，没错，你说得对。对。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, no, you're right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:25.24,0:32:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}重新开始。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:25.24,0:32:26.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fresh start.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:29.45,0:32:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你会忘了我是谁。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:29.45,0:32:30.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're gonna forget who I am.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:31.62,0:32:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}忘了自己是谁？你在说什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:31.62,0:32:33.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Forget who you are? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:33.49,0:32:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，我会去找你， 再把一切都解释清楚。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:33.49,0:32:37.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. I'm gonna come and find you, and I'll explain everything.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我爱……  -先等等。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I love...   -Just wait.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:41.46,0:32:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等着，再看见我就告诉我。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.46,0:32:43.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait and tell me when you see me again.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:48.05,0:32:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我叫彼得·帕克，想来杯咖啡。
Dialogue: 1,0:32:48.05,0:32:52.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My name is Peter Parker, and I would like a coffee.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:53.72,0:32:55.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有别的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:53.72,0:32:55.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.32,0:33:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.32,0:33:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:08.05,0:34:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.05,0:34:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:10.38,0:34:11.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:10.38,0:34:11.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:13.68,0:34:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为有了超能力， 就不用听我的了？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.68,0:34:17.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You think you don't have to listen to me now that you've got powers?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:22.23,0:34:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道，这……这整件事真会吓坏人。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:22.23,0:34:27.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, this... this whole thing can get really scary.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:28.19,0:34:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:28.19,0:34:29.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know that?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:30.57,0:34:32.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，是啊，已经挺吓人了。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:30.57,0:34:32.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, yeah, it's already pretty scary.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:34.45,0:34:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:34.45,0:34:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.03,0:34:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}情况可能转变， 而且……转眼就变了。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.03,0:34:38.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And things can change, like......very quickly,
Dialogue: 2,0:34:38.99,0:34:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}以我们现在想都想不到的方式。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:38.99,0:34:41.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}in ways that we can't even imagine right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:41.91,0:34:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}信我，我知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:41.91,0:34:43.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Believe me, I Know.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看你根本不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't think you do know.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:50.55,0:34:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:50.55,0:34:51.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:51.63,0:34:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-[倒吸气，喘气]
Dialogue: 1,0:34:51.63,0:34:54.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,0:35:17.16,0:35:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。哇！
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.16,0:35:18.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God. Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:00.57,0:36:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:00.57,0:36:01.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:19.55,0:36:20.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，我，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:36:19.55,0:36:20.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, I, uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:36:21.80,0:36:22.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我住这儿。我就是，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:36:21.80,0:36:22.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I live here. I just, um...
Dialogue: 2,0:36:25.43,0:36:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我去拿我的东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:25.43,0:36:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm gonna grab my stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:45.20,0:36:46.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是我的衬衫吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:45.20,0:36:46.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is that my shirt?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:48.83,0:36:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:48.83,0:36:49.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:50.58,0:36:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哦，这狗真可爱。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.58,0:36:51.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, cute dog.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:51.88,0:36:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，糟……
Dialogue: 1,0:36:51.88,0:36:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, sh...
Dialogue: 2,0:36:58.43,0:36:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:36:58.43,0:36:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:20.32,0:37:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨，彼得。你有107条新提醒。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:20.32,0:37:23.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hi, Peter. You have new alerts.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:23.74,0:37:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请查看待办事项。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.74,0:37:25.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please check backlog.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:31.83,0:37:35.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:31.83,0:37:35.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What is happening?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:36.21,0:37:39.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}身体扫描结果显示 你的激素激增
Dialogue: 1,0:37:36.21,0:37:39.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The results of your body scan show a surge in the hormones
Dialogue: 2,0:37:39.42,0:37:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}与你的蛛形纲动物DNA有关，
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.42,0:37:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}associated with your arachnid DNA,
Dialogue: 2,0:37:41.89,0:37:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}结果长出了有机吐丝器
Dialogue: 1,0:37:41.89,0:37:44.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}resulting in the formation of organic web spinnerets
Dialogue: 2,0:37:44.76,0:37:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}以及危险增强的感官受体
Dialogue: 1,0:37:44.76,0:37:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and dangerously heightened sensory receptors.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:47.81,0:37:49.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 好吧，可我感觉没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.81,0:37:49.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Okay, but I feel fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:50.14,0:37:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}长期孤立或情感创伤
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.14,0:37:52.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Prolonged isolation or emotional trauma
Dialogue: 2,0:37:52.52,0:37:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可能是这次突变的原因之一。
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.52,0:37:54.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}could be contributing to this sudden change.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:55.06,0:37:57.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}最近经历过什么创伤事件吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:55.06,0:37:57.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Have you experienced any recent traumatic events?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:00.57,0:38:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}彼得？
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.57,0:38:01.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Peter?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:02.20,0:38:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我没事，E.V.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:02.20,0:38:03.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm fine, E.V.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你看起来不太好。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't seem fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:05.28,0:38:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我建议你花-点
Dialogue: 1,0:38:05.28,0:38:06.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I recommend you take
Dialogue: 2,0:38:06.45,0:38:07.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}时间找回平衡。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:06.45,0:38:07.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-some time to rebalance.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:07.99,0:38:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可这也没得选，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:38:07.99,0:38:09.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, that's not really an option, is it?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}机械蛛丝发射器和有机蛛丝
Dialogue: 1,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mechanical web shooters and organic webs
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.72,0:38:30.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不能同时使用。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:28.72,0:38:30.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}cannot be used simultaneously.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:32.39,0:38:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}加油，彼得。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:32.39,0:38:33.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:53.50,0:38:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警报。感官超载。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:53.50,0:38:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alert. Senses are overloaded.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:58.13,0:39:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警报，感官超负荷。
Dialogue: 1,0:38:58.13,0:39:00.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alert. Senses are overloaded.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:02.84,0:39:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警报。警报。 感官超载。 警报。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:02.84,0:39:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alert. Alert. Senses are overloaded. Alert.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:09.56,0:39:11.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}刚才那他妈是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:09.56,0:39:11.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:11.72,0:39:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你的感官变敏锐了 一下接收了太多信息
Dialogue: 1,0:39:11.72,0:39:15.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Your heightened senses are taking in too much information at once.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:15.64,0:39:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。没事了。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:15.64,0:39:18.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:18.94,0:39:19.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:18.94,0:39:19.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:20.02,0:39:22.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，有机蛛丝。 彼得二号就有。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:20.02,0:39:22.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right, organic webs. Peter Two had 'em.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:22.74,0:39:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他很酷。你也很酷。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:22.74,0:39:24.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He was cool. You're cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:28.28,0:39:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[作呕，干呕]
Dialogue: 1,0:39:28.28,0:39:30.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}IGAGS, RETCHES]
Dialogue: 2,0:39:32.45,0:39:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃！天哪，丑死了。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:32.45,0:39:34.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ugh! Oh, my God, that's hideous.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:34.87,0:39:36.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，开始吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.87,0:39:36.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:38.96,0:39:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，这招没用。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:38.96,0:39:41.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, that didn't work.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:41.75,0:39:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有机蛛丝。来吧！吐丝！
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.75,0:39:43.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Organic webs. Come on! And web!
Dialogue: 2,0:39:47.51,0:39:48.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不！
Dialogue: 1,0:39:47.51,0:39:48.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, no!
Dialogue: 2,0:39:51.56,0:39:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}住手！
Dialogue: 1,0:39:51.56,0:39:53.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:39:54.81,0:39:57.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-怎么回事，E.V.？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:54.81,0:39:57.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What's going on, E.V.?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:57.69,0:40:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}曼哈顿损害控制局数据中心 发生枪击。
Dialogue: 1,0:39:57.69,0:40:01.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shots fired at the Damage Control Data Center in Manhattan.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嫌疑人面容与蝎子吻合。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Suspect facial match with Scorpion.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:03.86,0:40:05.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我这就过去。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:03.86,0:40:05.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:05.90,0:40:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来吧。Three，two……
Dialogue: 1,0:40:05.90,0:40:07.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on. Three, two...
Dialogue: 2,0:40:07.95,0:40:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.95,0:40:08.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:12.37,0:40:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-蛛丝，停下！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:12.37,0:40:15.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Web, stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:16.46,0:40:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝！停！鸟，鸟，鸟！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.46,0:40:18.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web! Stop! Birds, birds, birds!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:18.58,0:40:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝！停下。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:18.58,0:40:20.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web! Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.42,0:40:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.42,0:40:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 2,0:40:24.71,0:40:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起。对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:24.71,0:40:26.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:26.80,0:40:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝！停下。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:26.80,0:40:28.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web! Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:28.38,0:40:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，天哪！
Dialogue: 1,0:40:28.38,0:40:30.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:30.22,0:40:32.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-蛛丝！停，停，停。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:30.22,0:40:32.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Web! Stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:56.12,0:40:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道你在找什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:56.12,0:40:58.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't Know what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:58.21,0:41:00.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我在找V-Max。
Dialogue: 1,0:40:58.21,0:41:00.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm looking for V-Max.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我什么都不知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't Know anything.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:05.00,0:41:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要亲眼看看。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:05.00,0:41:06.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll see for myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:09.63,0:41:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-天啊，天啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:41:09.63,0:41:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, God, oh, God!
Dialogue: 2,0:41:14.97,0:41:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:14.97,0:41:16.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:19.27,0:41:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抱歉，我来晚了。 我今天真是忙疯了。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:19.27,0:41:21.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry I'm late. I've had a really crazy day.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:40.50,0:41:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蝎子，咱们非得一直这 样吗？ 我头疼死了。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:40.50,0:41:43.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Scorpion, do we really gotta keep doing this? My head is killing me.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:44.92,0:41:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为我是蝎子？
Dialogue: 1,0:41:44.92,0:41:46.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You think I'm Scorpion?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:48.13,0:41:49.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-蛛丝！
Dialogue: 1,0:41:48.13,0:41:49.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Web!
Dialogue: 2,0:41:51.13,0:41:52.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你这是怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:41:51.13,0:41:52.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's happening to you?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:58.98,0:42:00.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咦。
Dialogue: 1,0:41:58.98,0:42:00.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Huh.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:00.44,0:42:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你再也感应不到我了。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:00.44,0:42:01.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You can't sense me anymore.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:05.44,0:42:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:05.44,0:42:06.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:06.52,0:42:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你怎么了，蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:06.52,0:42:08.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's going on with you, Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:17.66,0:42:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警告。蛛类激素正在升高。
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.66,0:42:20.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Warning. Arachnid hormones increasing.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:36.01,0:42:37.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是谁？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:36.01,0:42:37.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:38.01,0:42:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道自己是谁吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:38.01,0:42:39.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you know who you are?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:03.58,0:43:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这边需要帮忙。退后！让一让。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:03.58,0:43:05.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We need some help over here. Get back! Coming through.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:14.59,0:43:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:14.59,0:43:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:18.35,0:43:19.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:18.35,0:43:19.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:19.81,0:43:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谁去叫个医护人员。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:19.81,0:43:21.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Somebody get a medic.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:41.66,0:43:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}DeWolff，她受伤了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.66,0:43:42.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}DeWolff, is she hurt?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:43.87,0:43:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:43.87,0:43:44.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:45.29,0:43:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-她还好吗？不好！
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.29,0:43:46.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-ls she okay? No!
Dialogue: 2,0:43:46.71,0:43:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就放我走吧…… -别！你到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:46.71,0:43:48.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Just let me go...   -Don't! What is going on with you?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:48.88,0:43:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那不是蝎子，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:48.88,0:43:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That wasn't Scorpion, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:50.13,0:43:51.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，是没错，
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.13,0:43:51.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean it was,
Dialogue: 2,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但他被劫持那辆坦克的 东西 附身了，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but he was possessed by whatever hijacked that tank, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:54.05,0:43:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-听着，求你让我先……  -好，听我说。慢点。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:54.05,0:43:56.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Look, please can I just...   -All right, listen. Slow down.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:58.72,0:44:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，我不知道这是怎么回 事， 但你得振作起来。
Dialogue: 1,0:43:58.72,0:44:02.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Listen, I don't know what this is, but I need you to pull it together.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:03.10,0:44:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你差点杀了个警察。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.10,0:44:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You almost killed a cop.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:07.40,0:44:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这不是你。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.40,0:44:08.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This isn't you.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:09.02,0:44:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我|知道。对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.02,0:44:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I| Know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:10.65,0:44:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你再这样，我就保不了你了。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.65,0:44:13.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you act like this again, I cannot protect you.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:14.24,0:44:16.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不管这是什么，你得解决。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.24,0:44:16.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whatever this is, you need to fix it.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.26,0:44:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}通过格点色动力学，
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.26,0:44:40.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Through lattice chromodynamics,
Dialogue: 2,0:44:41.93,0:44:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们能把时间和空间排成网格。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.93,0:44:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}we can arrange time and space in a grid.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:45.72,0:44:50.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样我们就能模拟夸克结合成质子。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:45.72,0:44:50.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Which allows us to simulate the quarks binding into the protons.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:51.73,0:44:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Cindy，你是在问质子吗
Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.73,0:44:53.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Cindy, is this a question about protons
Dialogue: 2,0:44:54.07,0:44:56.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-还是更多复仇者联盟的事？
Dialogue: 1,0:44:54.07,0:44:56.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-or more stuff about Avengers?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:56.24,0:44:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，各位，我爱讲故事，
Dialogue: 1,0:44:56.24,0:44:59.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Guys, I love to tell stories,
Dialogue: 2,0:44:59.70,0:45:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可你知道，我…… 我总得找 个时候 在这儿教你点物理。
Dialogue: 1,0:44:59.70,0:45:02.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but you know I... I gotta teach you some physics at some point here.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:07.08,0:45:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，放手干吧，辛迪。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:07.08,0:45:09.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right. Let it rip, Cindy.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:09.42,0:45:12.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是灭霸那么担心人口过剩，
Dialogue: 1,0:45:09.42,0:45:12.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If Thanos was so worried about over-population,
Dialogue: 2,0:45:12.67,0:45:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他怎么不用魔法手套多变点吃的？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:12.67,0:45:15.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}why didn't he just use the magic glove to make more food?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:19.76,0:45:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Arthur，你想回答这问题吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:19.76,0:45:21.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Arthur, you wanna answer that question?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.72,0:45:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}浩克，砸！
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.72,0:45:26.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hulk smash!
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.73,0:45:30.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就是这样。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.73,0:45:30.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There you have it.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:31.44,0:45:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-呃，打扰一下， 班纳博士， 我， 呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:45:31.44,0:45:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Uh, excuse me, Dr. Banner, I, um...
Dialogue: 2,0:45:35.32,0:45:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.32,0:45:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:45:36.90,0:45:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你没事吧？  -嗯，抱歉，只是头疼。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:36.90,0:45:38.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You okay?   -Yeah, sorry, it's just a headache.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:38.82,0:45:41.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，能占用你一分钟吗？ 我想跟你聊聊你的抑制器。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.82,0:45:41.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Um, have you got a minute? I wanted to talk to you about your inhibitor.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:42.45,0:45:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，当然。别担心。 它有多重保险。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.45,0:45:46.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh. Sure. Don't worry. It's got fail-safes.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.45,0:45:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我可不会在食堂里 变成 绿色的狂暴巨兽机器。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.45,0:45:50.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not gonna turn into the big green raging monster machine in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:51.21,0:45:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但你要是看见我没戴这东西，快跑。
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.21,0:45:53.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But if you do see me with this thing off, run.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:57.26,0:46:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不是，但你用的是 靶标特 异性短干扰RNA，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.26,0:46:00.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, but you're using target-specific short interfering RNA, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:02.05,0:46:04.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就像基因沉默，你只是 把伽马辐射加进去了？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.05,0:46:04.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's like gene silencing, you're just incorporating the gamma radiation?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:07.60,0:46:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你刚说你叫什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:07.60,0:46:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What'd you say your name was?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.02,0:46:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，内德……利兹。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.02,0:46:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, Ned... Leeds.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:13.27,0:46:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以你找到了 抑制DNA表达的办法
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.27,0:46:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So you found a way to suppress the expression of DNA
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.40,0:46:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就算它正因伽马辐射发生 变异 也一样，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.40,0:46:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}even as it's undergoing the mutation due to gamma radiation, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-对。  -好，我想问的是，
Dialogue: 1,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Yes.   -Okay, SO my question is,
Dialogue: 2,0:46:22.74,0:46:27.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是DNA因别的原因变异 也可能出现同样的情况吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.74,0:46:27.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}would that same thing be possible with DNA that's mutating for another reason?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:29.74,0:46:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:29.74,0:46:30.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's the reason?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:32.25,0:46:34.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:46:32.25,0:46:34.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know. Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:46:34.79,0:46:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}假设……宿主的……基因组 混入了某种外来DNA。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:34.79,0:46:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's say that the... the host genome is mixed with some kind of foreign DNA.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:38.84,0:46:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}理论上是。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.84,0:46:39.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Theoretically.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:41.01,0:46:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}理论上？对，有可能。对。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:41.01,0:46:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Theoretically? Yes, that's possible. Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你能只抑制 那段D NA的部分表达吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So, could you suppress only some parts of that DNA expression?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:47.93,0:46:50.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}比如那些不好的方面， 但好的全留下？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:47.93,0:46:50.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like the bad aspects but just keep all of the good stuff?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:51.35,0:46:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是说我想留浩克的一部分，别的不要？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:51.35,0:46:54.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You mean, like, if I wanted to keep some parts of Hulk but not others?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:54.44,0:46:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。
Dialogue: 1,0:46:54.44,0:46:55.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:56.06,0:47:00.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那会极其危险又复杂，但……
Dialogue: 1,0:46:56.06,0:47:00.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It would be enormously dangerous and complex, but...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:01.36,0:47:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是你能锁定正确的MRNA链……
Dialogue: 1,0:47:01.36,0:47:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}if you were able to target the correct MRNA strand...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:06.03,0:47:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有可能。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:06.03,0:47:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Possibly.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:07.20,0:47:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，你是说 你能随意开关变异基因？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:07.20,0:47:09.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, so you could just turn the mutating gene on and off
Dialogue: 2,0:47:09.74,0:47:12.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只要你在mRNA转录前做完？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:09.74,0:47:12.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}as long as you do it before the mRNA transcription?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:12.91,0:47:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也许吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.91,0:47:13.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:16.17,0:47:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，按同样的思路，你甚至能……
Dialogue: 1,0:47:16.17,0:47:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, if you apply the same thinking, you could even...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:19.09,0:47:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}研发某种自动抑制器
Dialogue: 1,0:47:19.09,0:47:21.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}develop some kind of automatic inhibitor
Dialogue: 2,0:47:21.21,0:47:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那就能适应任何类型的变异。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.21,0:47:24.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that would just adjust to any type of mutation.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:25.26,0:47:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你现在说的就是通用抑制剂了
Dialogue: 1,0:47:25.26,0:47:28.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, now you're talking about a universal inhibitor
Dialogue: 2,0:47:28.18,0:47:31.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那就能控制所有有超能力的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:28.18,0:47:31.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that would control anyone who has any powers.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:32.68,0:47:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这想法很危险。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:32.68,0:47:33.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's a dangerous idea.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:35.10,0:47:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，是。但只是理论，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:35.10,0:47:37.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, yeah. But it's theoretical, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:39.82,0:47:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不是我的学生吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:39.82,0:47:41.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're not one of my students, are ya?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:43.82,0:47:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-不是。我是研究生。  -嗯。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:43.82,0:47:45.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No. I'm a grad student.   -Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.16,0:47:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.16,0:47:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've, uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}已经耽误你够久了。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've taken enough of your time.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:49.41,0:47:51.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我得把几本书还给图书馆。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:49.41,0:47:51.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I gotta get some books back to the library.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:51.91,0:47:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}图书馆在那边。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:51.91,0:47:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The library is that way.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:55.25,0:47:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。对。瞧我这脑子。
Dialogue: 1,0:47:55.25,0:47:57.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right. Right. Duh.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:57.50,0:47:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你会怎么决定？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.50,0:47:58.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How would you decide?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:59.71,0:48:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.71,0:48:00.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What's that?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.80,0:48:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那大自然哪些方面好，哪些不好？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.80,0:48:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, what parts of nature are good or bad?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:04.59,0:48:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是你在试着控制表情呢
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.59,0:48:06.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What if you're trying to control the expression
Dialogue: 2,0:48:06.59,0:48:08.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}某种需要表达的东西？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:06.59,0:48:08.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}of something that needs to be expressed?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:14.39,0:48:15.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}祝你学业顺利，内德。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.39,0:48:15.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Good luck with your studies, Ned.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.85,0:48:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢您，教授。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.85,0:48:19.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thank you, Professor.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:20.11,0:48:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}像爬行动物一样……
Dialogue: 1,0:48:20.11,0:48:21.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like reptiles...
Dialogue: 2,0:48:21.32,0:48:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊。-……两栖动物和节肢动物，
Dialogue: 1,0:48:21.32,0:48:23.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, God.   -...amphibians and arthropods,
Dialogue: 2,0:48:23.78,0:48:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛会蜕皮
Dialogue: 1,0:48:23.78,0:48:24.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}spiders shed skin
Dialogue: 2,0:48:25.07,0:48:26.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-在它们生命周期的关键时刻。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:25.07,0:48:26.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-at key points in their life cycles.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:27.28,0:48:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这个过程叫蜕皮。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:27.28,0:48:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-The process is known as molting.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:29.45,0:48:31.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}第四个抑制器原型已完成。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.45,0:48:31.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fourth inhibitor prototype complete.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:31.99,0:48:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}虽然蜕皮是蜘蛛生命周 期的 -自然环节…
Dialogue: 1,0:48:31.99,0:48:33.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}While molting is a natural
Dialogue: 2,0:48:33.16,0:48:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这只是蜘蛛生命周期的一部分…… 好了，来吧，来吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:33.16,0:48:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-part of a spider's life cycle... Okay, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:35.54,0:48:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……会让蜘蛛容易受到威胁。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:35.54,0:48:37.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}.../f can leave the spider vulnerable to threats.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:37.58,0:48:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}上传抑制器测试版，构建号七。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:37.58,0:48:39.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Upload inhibitor beta build seven.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:40.00,0:48:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……激素变化启动了这个过程……
Dialogue: 1,0:48:40.00,0:48:41.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}... process is initiated by hormonal changes...
Dialogue: 2,0:48:41.38,0:48:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}上传好了。要不要测试一下？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.38,0:48:43.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uploaded. Would you like to run a test?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.17,0:48:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行，开始吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.17,0:48:45.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, run it.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:45.26,0:48:47.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……几小时到几天。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:45.26,0:48:47.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}...few hours to several days.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:47.09,0:48:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛的生命周期分三个阶段。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:47.09,0:48:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spiders have three stages in their life cycle.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:50.97,0:48:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}每个阶段都有身体变化，
Dialogue: 1,0:48:50.97,0:48:54.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Each stage is characterized by physical changes,
Dialogue: 2,0:48:54.26,0:48:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}迈向成年的美好过渡期， 变化最大。
Dialogue: 1,0:48:54.26,0:48:59.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}with the largest changes occurring during the beautiful transition to adulthood.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:02.06,0:49:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对那些挺过来的人来说，
Dialogue: 1,0:49:02.06,0:49:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}For those who make it through,
Dialogue: 2,0:49:03.94,0:49:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜕皮就像是一次重生。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:03.94,0:49:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}molting amounts to a kind of rebirth.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:06.32,0:49:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能关掉那蜘蛛玩意儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.32,0:49:07.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can you turn that spider stuff off?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:07.78,0:49:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在关闭视频。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.78,0:49:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Turning off video.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:10.03,0:49:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-抑制器已启动。  -好，开始了。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:10.03,0:49:11.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-lnhibitor active.   -Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:11.57,0:49:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点。快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.57,0:49:13.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:14.49,0:49:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}盯着我的生命体征。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.49,0:49:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Keep an eye on my vitals.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:18.46,0:49:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抑制器已启动。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:18.46,0:49:19.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Inhibitor engaged.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:23.96,0:49:27.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把蛛类激素压到你的基准水平。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:23.96,0:49:27.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Suppressing arachnid hormones to your baseline levels.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:30.43,0:49:31.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.43,0:49:31.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:35.47,0:49:36.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，E.V.，咱们开始吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:35.47,0:49:36.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right, E.V., let's do this.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.06,0:49:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}启动第一次实地测试。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.06,0:49:39.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Initiating field test one.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:40.98,0:49:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}起作用了。警报。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:40.98,0:49:42.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's working. Alert.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:42.69,0:49:44.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-抑制器过热了。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:42.69,0:49:44.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-lnhibitor is overheating.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:44.94,0:49:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}功能下降。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:44.94,0:49:46.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Functionality reducing.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:46.19,0:49:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，我感觉到了。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.19,0:49:47.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I'm sensing that.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:47.98,0:49:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警报。感官超负荷。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:47.98,0:49:49.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alert. Senses are overloaded.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:49.94,0:49:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}警报。感官已超负荷。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.94,0:49:51.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Alert. Senses are overloaded.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:51.82,0:49:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-感官超负荷。警报。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:51.82,0:49:54.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Senses are overloaded. Alert.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:54.16,0:49:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝手雷已启动。
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.16,0:49:56.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web grenades activated.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:58.70,0:50:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，靠……
Dialogue: 1,0:49:58.70,0:50:00.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, sh...
Dialogue: 2,0:50:12.18,0:50:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抑制力场第一次测试，失败。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:12.18,0:50:14.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Inhibitor field test one, failure.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:17.39,0:50:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，蜘蛛侠，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:17.39,0:50:20.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yo, Spider-Man, you okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:20.89,0:50:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，我就试试新技术。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:20.89,0:50:22.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. I'm just trying out some new tech.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:23.52,0:50:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对。为了除掉你体内的怪物？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:23.52,0:50:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah. To get rid of that monster inside you?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:31.86,0:50:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还是感应不到我，是吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:31.86,0:50:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Still can't sense me, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:34.95,0:50:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看来你的技术不管用了。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:34.95,0:50:36.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Guess your technology isn't working.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:37.99,0:50:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，你是我遇到的人 里， 唯一一个我没法……
Dialogue: 1,0:50:37.99,0:50:40.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, you're the only person I've met that I can't...
Dialogue: 2,0:50:41.37,0:50:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}跳进去。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.37,0:50:42.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}hop into.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:43.42,0:50:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这肯定让你特别心烦。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.42,0:50:45.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sure that's really frustrating for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:45.50,0:50:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，我总有一天会进去的。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:45.50,0:50:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, I'll get in there one day.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你想要什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you want?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:48.25,0:50:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎呀。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:48.25,0:50:49.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:50.00,0:50:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想知道 一个半人半蜘蛛的家伙 为什么会决定为一个组织工作
Dialogue: 1,0:50:50.00,0:50:55.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I wanna know why a half-human, half-spider would decide to work for an organization
Dialogue: 2,0:50:55.51,0:50:59.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}誓以追杀所有异类为使命。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:55.51,0:50:59.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}whose sworn mission is to hunt down anybody who's different.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:59.14,0:51:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}损害控制局追捕你， 不是因为你与众不同。
Dialogue: 1,0:50:59.14,0:51:02.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Damage Control isn't after you because you're different.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:03.35,0:51:05.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们到处抓你，因为你很危险。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:03.35,0:51:05.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They're hunting you down because you're dangerous.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:05.31,0:51:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在，你想要什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.31,0:51:06.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, what do you want?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:07.61,0:51:11.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你这蜘蛛脑子太简单， 我就把话给你说明白。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.61,0:51:11.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Since you're a very simple spider, let me spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:12.78,0:51:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}损害控制局有我需要的东西。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:12.78,0:51:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Damage Control has something that I need.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:16.12,0:51:17.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，你是说V-Max？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:16.12,0:51:17.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, you mean V-Max?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.49,0:51:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我本打算利用蝎子拿到它， 可你一直碍我的事。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.49,0:51:23.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I was planning to use Scorpion to get it, but you keep getting in my way.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:24.46,0:51:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我会一直挡着你的路。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:24.46,0:51:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I will always be in your way.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:27.04,0:51:29.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，你确定吗，彼得·帕克？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:27.04,0:51:29.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, you sure about that, Peter Parker?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:34.80,0:51:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，你这公寓有点像恶搞作品
Dialogue: 1,0:51:34.80,0:51:37.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, your apartment is kinda like a parody
Dialogue: 2,0:51:37.97,0:51:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你觉得20多岁的可怜单身汉 可能住在哪儿。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.97,0:51:41.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}of where you think a sad single guy in his 20s might live.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:41.72,0:51:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}外卖盒、自由重量器械、蛋白粉。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:41.72,0:51:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Take-out containers, free weights, protein powder.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:51.28,0:51:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你在虚张声势。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:51.28,0:51:52.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:52.69,0:51:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，找到你不难，彼得。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.69,0:51:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, you're not hard to track down, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:55.20,0:51:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，至少对我这种人来说不是。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.20,0:51:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, at least not for someone like me.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:59.53,0:52:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过我倒发现了一件有趣的事。
Dialogue: 1,0:51:59.53,0:52:01.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I did find one interesting thing, though.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:02.87,0:52:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}偏偏是在……
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.87,0:52:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}In of all places...
Dialogue: 2,0:52:06.37,0:52:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}咖啡杯。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:06.37,0:52:07.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}coffee cup.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:10.04,0:52:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}E.V.，显示家庭工作站。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:10.04,0:52:11.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}E.V., display home work station.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:14.30,0:52:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你花了四年 抹去了彼得·帕克的存在？
Dialogue: 1,0:52:14.30,0:52:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You spent four years erasing Peter Parker from existence?
Dialogue: 2,0:52:18.76,0:52:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}难怪蜘蛛想把那个人吞掉。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:18.76,0:52:21.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No wonder the spider's trying to swallow up the man.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:21.89,0:52:23.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不知道MJ还能不能认出你。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.89,0:52:23.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I wonder if MJ would even recognize you.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:27.31,0:52:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想我可能会去看看她怎么样了。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:27.31,0:52:28.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think I might go see how she's doing.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:29.02,0:52:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不会让那种事发生。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:29.02,0:52:30.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:30.23,0:52:32.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，她室友人挺好的
Dialogue: 1,0:52:30.23,0:52:32.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, her roommate was nice enough
Dialogue: 2,0:52:32.23,0:52:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-把新地址发到网上。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:32.23,0:52:34.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-to post a new address online.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:34.44,0:52:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样吧，咱俩比谁先到。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:34.44,0:52:37.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How about this? I'll race you there.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:37.61,0:52:38.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你敢碰她的话……
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.61,0:52:38.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you touch her...
Dialogue: 2,0:52:39.28,0:52:40.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}最好赶紧荡起来。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.28,0:52:40.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Better start swinging.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:40.95,0:52:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我很快。
Dialogue: 1,0:52:40.95,0:52:42.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm fast.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:05.68,0:53:06.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:05.68,0:53:06.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:06.85,0:53:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}到MJ家还远着呢。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:06.85,0:53:08.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's a long way to MJ's.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:08.98,0:53:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你最好快点。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:08.98,0:53:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You better pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:18.36,0:53:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}E.V.，追踪身体异常。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:18.36,0:53:20.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}E.V., track physical anomalies.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:21.53,0:53:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在查找物理异常
Dialogue: 1,0:53:21.53,0:53:22.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Searching for physical anomalies
Dialogue: 2,0:53:23.03,0:53:24.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-对象之间。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:23.03,0:53:24.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-between subjects.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:24.58,0:53:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}请稍候。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.58,0:53:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please stand by.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:30.50,0:53:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}非常感谢大家今天到场。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:30.50,0:53:32.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thank you all so much for coming today.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:38.55,0:53:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……刚才的事，对不起。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.55,0:53:40.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh... I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:41.05,0:53:43.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为蜘蛛侠鼓掌！
Dialogue: 1,0:53:41.05,0:53:43.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Give it up for Spider-Man,
Dialogue: 2,0:53:43.10,0:53:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为赢得挚爱芳心，他拼命追赶
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.10,0:53:46.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}in a race for the love of his life, and it's not looking good.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点，蜘蛛侠。跟上。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, Spidey. Keep up.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.94,0:53:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}借过。不好意思。
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.94,0:53:52.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Excuse me. Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:01.82,0:54:02.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:01.82,0:54:02.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:06.49,0:54:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}E.V.，把这些数跟其他数一起算。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:06.49,0:54:08.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}E.V., run these numbers with the others.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:11.62,0:54:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在分析跳跃距离，寻找规律。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:11.62,0:54:13.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Analyzing jump distances for patterns.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:16.34,0:54:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把跳跃数据给我。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:16.34,0:54:17.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get me that jump data.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:18.09,0:54:19.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}计算中。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:18.09,0:54:19.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Calculating.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:22.97,0:54:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点，我得有个答案！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.97,0:54:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, I need an answer!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:26.22,0:54:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}计算完毕。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:26.22,0:54:27.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Calculations complete.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:43.40,0:54:45.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能跳的范围也有限吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:43.40,0:54:45.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You have a limit to your jump radius, don't ya?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:46.16,0:54:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}三十三英尺。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:46.16,0:54:47.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thirty-three feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:48.24,0:54:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我没看见这上头有谁能让你附身。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:48.24,0:54:50.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't see anybody up here for you to hop into.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:51.87,0:54:53.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真聪明。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:51.87,0:54:53.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Very clever.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:53.46,0:54:56.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我说过了，你别想靠近她。
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.46,0:54:56.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like I said, you're not getting near her.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:10.64,0:55:12.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，嘿，嘿。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.64,0:55:12.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:12.89,0:55:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起，你有危险。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:12.89,0:55:13.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry, but you're in danger.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:13.94,0:55:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你室友呢？  -什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:13.94,0:55:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Where's your roommate?   -What?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:15.02,0:55:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}内德在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:15.02,0:55:16.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where's Ned?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:16.10,0:55:17.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，在波士顿，跟朋友一起。怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:16.10,0:55:17.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, in Boston with friends. Why?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:17.36,0:55:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，行。你得跟我走。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.36,0:55:18.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, good. You gotta come with me.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:18.73,0:55:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？我不知道你是不是真蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:18.73,0:55:20.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What? I don't know if you're the real Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:20.53,0:55:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我不跟你走。  -没时间磨蹭了。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:20.53,0:55:22.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm not coming with you.   -We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-求你了。别这样。  -你得离开我的公寓。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Please. Come on.   -You need to get out of my apartment.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:24.36,0:55:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，这话听着会很离谱，
Dialogue: 1,0:55:24.36,0:55:25.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, this is gonna sound insane,
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.82,0:55:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但有人盯上你了，很危险
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.82,0:55:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but there is someone who is after you who is really dangerous, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:28.41,0:55:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也答应过你，会保护好你。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.41,0:55:30.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I promised you that I would keep you safe.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:30.28,0:55:33.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}求你了，你得相信我。拜托。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:30.28,0:55:33.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please, you just have to trust me. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:36.71,0:55:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}行。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:36.71,0:55:37.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:44.47,0:55:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝。停。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:44.47,0:55:45.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web. Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:49.14,0:55:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛网。停。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:49.14,0:55:50.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web. Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:54.31,0:55:55.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛网。停。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.31,0:55:55.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web. Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:59.86,0:56:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 你没事吧？ 嗯，嗯，我没事。
Dialogue: 1,0:55:59.86,0:56:02.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Are you okay? Yeah, yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:02.44,0:56:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了。呃，在这上面应该安全了。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:02.44,0:56:04.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Uh, we should be safe up here.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:05.03,0:56:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，那能避开什么危险？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.03,0:56:06.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, well, safe from what?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:06.20,0:56:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，我也不太确定。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:06.20,0:56:08.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, I'm not entirely sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:08.87,0:56:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，那他们找我干嘛？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.87,0:56:10.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, well, what do they want with me?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:10.49,0:56:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。你不知道？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:10.49,0:56:12.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know. You don't know?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:13.37,0:56:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这根本说不通。 他们为什么会选我？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:13.37,0:56:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It doesn't make any sense. Why would they choose me?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:16.54,0:56:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，我也想告诉你。我只是……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:16.54,0:56:18.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Um, I wish I could tell you. I just...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:18.79,0:56:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:18.79,0:56:19.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:21.42,0:56:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们以前认识，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.42,0:56:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We knew each other, didn't we?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:26.63,0:56:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.63,0:56:27.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:28.64,0:56:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是唯一的解释。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.64,0:56:29.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's the only explanation.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这事让我抓狂好几年了，
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's been driving me crazy for years,
Dialogue: 2,0:56:32.76,0:56:35.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠每次救我或内德的时候。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:32.76,0:56:35.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}all the times that Spider-Man saved either me or Ned.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:35.85,0:56:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}先是Washington Monument， 后来是London、
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.85,0:56:36.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It was the Washington Monument,
Dialogue: 2,0:56:37.02,0:56:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}Prague， 还有Night Monkey。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.02,0:56:39.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and then it was London and Prague and the Night Monkey.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:40.48,0:56:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，两次算巧合， 可一次又一次……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.48,0:56:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, twice is a coincidence, but over and over again...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:45.32,0:56:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们以前认识。告诉我，我说错了。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:45.32,0:56:47.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We knew each other. Tell me I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:49.07,0:56:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你可错了。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.07,0:56:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:50.24,0:56:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们以前是什么关系？ 同学、朋友，还是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:50.24,0:56:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What were we? Were we classmates or friends or something?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:53.62,0:56:55.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，我……我不知道你在说什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:53.62,0:56:55.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, I... I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:56.04,0:56:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们曾有过更深的关系吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:56.04,0:56:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Were we something more?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:59.37,0:57:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我就是，我想不……想不起来。
Dialogue: 1,0:56:59.37,0:57:01.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I just, I can't... I can't remember.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:01.84,0:57:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我还觉得脑子像被人搅乱了。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:01.84,0:57:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I feel like someone scrambled my brain.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:03.92,0:57:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也只有你知道为什么。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:03.92,0:57:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you're the only one who would know why.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:06.42,0:57:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}太疯狂了。我没法……
Dialogue: 1,0:57:06.42,0:57:08.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is crazy. I can't...
Dialogue: 2,0:57:08.26,0:57:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道你没法跟我说实话。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:08.26,0:57:10.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I Know that you can't tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.14,0:57:14.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可我得知道。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.14,0:57:14.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But I need to know.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:19.56,0:57:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也许我心里有一部分还记得。
Dialogue: 1,0:57:19.56,0:57:21.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe there's a part of me that still remembers.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:02.19,0:58:03.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}彼得。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:02.19,0:58:03.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Peter.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:05.23,0:58:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MJ.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:05.23,0:58:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}MJ.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:06.40,0:58:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，彼得。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:06.40,0:58:07.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:13.74,0:58:15.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我太想你了。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:13.74,0:58:15.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've missed you so much.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:20.41,0:58:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真不敢相信你居然想明白了。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:20.41,0:58:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't believe you figured it out.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:22.54,0:58:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我做了。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.54,0:58:23.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I did.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:29.34,0:58:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}来吧，彼得。碰她。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:29.34,0:58:31.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Go ahead, Peter. Touch her.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:33.22,0:58:34.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抓住她。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:33.22,0:58:34.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hold her.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.89,0:58:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你想这么做已经很久了。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.89,0:58:37.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You've been wanting to for so long.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真爱之吻能解除魔咒
Dialogue: 1,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}True love's kiss breaks the spell
Dialogue: 2,0:58:48.78,0:58:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}又让这对苦命恋人重聚。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:48.78,0:58:50.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and reunites the star-crossed lovers.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:52.86,0:58:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MJ会吐的。
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.86,0:58:54.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}MJ would vomit.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:56.78,0:58:58.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你还真是只单纯的蜘蛛，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:56.78,0:58:58.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You really are a simple spider, aren't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:01.96,0:59:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我懂你为什么喜欢她了。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:01.96,0:59:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I see why you like her.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:03.62,0:59:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她，呃……
Dialogue: 1,0:59:03.62,0:59:04.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's, uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:05.83,0:59:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她很聪明……
Dialogue: 1,0:59:05.83,0:59:07.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}she's smart...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:07.79,0:59:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真好笑……
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.79,0:59:08.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}funny...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:09.71,0:59:11.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有点阴暗扭曲。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:09.71,0:59:11.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and a little dark and twisted.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:15.05,0:59:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，确实挺难过的。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:15.05,0:59:16.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, it is sad.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:17.26,0:59:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这里面，就没一点关于你的念头……
Dialogue: 1,0:59:17.26,0:59:20.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There is, like, no thoughts of you in here...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:21.77,0:59:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}任何。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:21.77,0:59:22.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}whatsoever.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:24.52,0:59:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可你早就知道了，对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:59:24.52,0:59:25.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But you knew that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是个怪物。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're a monster.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}如果你像我爱她那样爱一个人
Dialogue: 1,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you loved someone the way that I love her,
Dialogue: 2,0:59:31.36,0:59:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你就会知道 你现在做的事不可原谅。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.36,0:59:34.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}then you'd know that what you're doing right now is unforgivable.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:34.24,0:59:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:59:34.24,0:59:35.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:42.33,0:59:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，有些人不惜杀人， 只为最后抱一次心爱的人。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:42.33,0:59:45.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, some people would kill to hold the person they love one last time.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.29,0:59:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}马上住手。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:47.29,0:59:48.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stop it now.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:56.05,0:59:57.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎哟。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:56.05,0:59:57.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oof.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:58.47,0:59:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}彼得，你快没时间了。
Dialogue: 1,0:59:58.47,0:59:59.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're running out of time, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:01.01,1:00:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}很快，忘记彼得·帕克的 就不只是你的朋友了。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.01,1:00:04.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Soon enough, it won't just be your friends who don't remember Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:06.02,1:00:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也许你该给自己写封信。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:06.02,1:00:07.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Maybe you should write a letter to yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:12.36,1:00:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}从她身体里出来。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:12.36,1:00:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get out of her.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:14.94,1:00:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在谁才是怪物，Peter？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.94,1:00:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who's the monster now, Peter?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:39.68,1:00:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MJ.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:39.68,1:00:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}MJ.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MJ。不，不，不。天哪。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}MJ. No, no, no. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:43.72,1:00:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊，求你了，别这样，拜托。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:43.72,1:00:45.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God, please, no, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:45.43,1:00:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点，快点，快点。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:45.43,1:00:47.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:47.18,1:00:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢天谢地，谢天谢地。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:47.18,1:00:49.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, thank God. Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:49.81,1:00:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事就好，没事就好。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:49.81,1:00:52.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, you're okay. Oh, you're okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:52.82,1:00:54.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-噢，真对不起。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:52.82,1:00:54.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:56.53,1:00:58.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}停。 等等，等等，停， 停。 求你了，我退出。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:56.53,1:00:58.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stop. Wait, wait, stop, stop, please, I'll quit.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:58.86,1:01:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你……你赢了，你赢了， 你赢了。 只要别伤害她。
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.86,1:01:00.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You... You win, you win, you win. Just don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:04.04,1:01:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你真狼狈，蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:04.04,1:01:05.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're a mess, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:08.21,1:01:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只要我想……
Dialogue: 1,1:01:08.21,1:01:09.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Anytime I want...
Dialogue: 2,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想当谁就能当谁。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can be anyone I want.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以你保护不了MJ，
Dialogue: 1,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So you can't protect MJ,
Dialogue: 2,1:01:15.55,1:01:17.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}甚至连她自己也瞒着。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:15.55,1:01:17.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}even from herself.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:24.35,1:01:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这封信写得真不错。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.35,1:01:26.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It really is a nice letter.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:26.98,1:01:28.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有点用力过猛。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.98,1:01:28.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Little heavy-handed.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:28.10,1:01:29.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过还不错。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:28.10,1:01:29.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But not bad.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:48.25,1:01:50.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事了。 我带你去个安全的地方。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:48.25,1:01:50.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're okay. I'm gonna take you someplace safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:50.87,1:01:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:50.87,1:01:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}带我去3165……
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Take me to 3165...
Dialogue: 2,1:01:54.59,1:01:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}拉法叶街。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:54.59,1:01:55.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Lafayette Street.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:55.92,1:01:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在导航至帝国州立大学。
Dialogue: 1,1:01:55.92,1:01:58.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Navigating to Empire State University.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:03.30,1:02:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，等等，等等！好吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.30,1:02:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, wait, wait! Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:06.93,1:02:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我接住你了。我接住你了。你确定吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:06.93,1:02:07.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got you. I got you. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:07.97,1:02:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。-好。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:07.97,1:02:08.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Yep.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:09.06,1:02:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为我感觉自己有点失控了。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:09.06,1:02:10.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}'Cause I feel like I'm slipping a little bit.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:10.31,1:02:11.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你没退步。好吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.31,1:02:11.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You're not slipping. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:13.19,1:02:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事，你没事，你没事。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:13.19,1:02:14.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're okay, you're Okay, you're okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:14.52,1:02:16.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，嗯，嗯。我没事。我没事。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.52,1:02:16.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:19.03,1:02:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.03,1:02:20.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:20.57,1:02:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们能不能慢一点
Dialogue: 1,1:02:20.57,1:02:21.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can we just slow down
Dialogue: 2,1:02:21.95,1:02:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-就两秒，行吗？  -嗯，我们快到了。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:21.95,1:02:23.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-for like two seconds, please?   -Well, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:23.32,1:02:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，对，可你刚才还说 我被人控制了心智。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:23.32,1:02:25.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, yeah, but you just told me I was mind controlled.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:25.74,1:02:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，严格说不算。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:25.74,1:02:26.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, not technically.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:26.83,1:02:27.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，幸好我信那套，懂吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:26.83,1:02:27.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, you're lucky I believe in that stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:28.08,1:02:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为政府这么干已经很多年了，
Dialogue: 1,1:02:28.08,1:02:29.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Because governments have been doing it for years,
Dialogue: 2,1:02:29.33,1:02:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-尤其是法国人。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:29.33,1:02:30.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-especially the French.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:30.91,1:02:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你没事吧？嗯……
Dialogue: 1,1:02:30.91,1:02:32.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Are you okay? Yeah...
Dialogue: 2,1:02:32.21,1:02:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听我说，对不起。 我只是想带 你去个安全的地方， 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.21,1:02:34.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look. Sorry. I'm just trying to take you someplace safe, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:39.21,1:02:40.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得不安全。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.21,1:02:40.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't feel safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:42.55,1:02:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}卧槽。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:42.55,1:02:43.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:48.56,1:02:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抱歉。哦，小心！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:48.56,1:02:50.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry. Oh, watch out!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:59.36,1:03:00.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你快疯了，小子。
Dialogue: 1,1:02:59.36,1:03:00.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're losing it, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:00.99,1:03:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还以为你早就能料到呢。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:00.99,1:03:03.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thought you'd be able to see that coming a mile away.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:03.61,1:03:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.61,1:03:04.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:04.78,1:03:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你差点害死我们。 不好意思。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.78,1:03:05.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You could've killed us. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:06.41,1:03:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你不打招呼就来我家， 你以为会怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:06.41,1:03:08.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You show up to my house unannounced, what do you think's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:09.04,1:03:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，这是你家？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:09.04,1:03:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, this is your house?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:10.16,1:03:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不。别，别，别。 -那他妈是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:10.16,1:03:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No, no. Don't, don't, don't.   -Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:11.66,1:03:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你他妈是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:11.66,1:03:12.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:12.75,1:03:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她，呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:12.75,1:03:14.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's, um...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:14.42,1:03:16.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，你知道的。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:14.42,1:03:16.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, you Know.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:16.38,1:03:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，我不知道。 所以才问你啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.38,1:03:18.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, I don't Know. That's why I just asked you.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.54,1:03:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她有危险，弗兰克。 听着 ，我需要你帮忙，行吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.54,1:03:21.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's in danger, Frank. Look, I need your help, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:21.46,1:03:23.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，看来是。好了，走吧。 你欠我的。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.46,1:03:23.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, looks like it. Well, come on. You owe me.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:23.59,1:03:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}啊，真是……这故事你还没听腻？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.59,1:03:25.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ah, for... Aren't you sick of this story?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:25.47,1:03:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}史泰登岛！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.47,1:03:26.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Staten Island!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:26.55,1:03:28.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不是，是斯塔滕岛。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:26.55,1:03:28.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Nah, Staten Island.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:28.10,1:03:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你还想让我做什么？ 我可是救了你的命。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:28.10,1:03:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What more do you want me to do? I literally saved your life.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:30.64,1:03:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你疯了吧，小子！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.64,1:03:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're out of your mind, kid!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:31.72,1:03:32.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么，我得救它两次 -你才肯帮我个忙？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.72,1:03:32.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What, I gotta save it twice
Dialogue: 2,1:03:32.89,1:03:34.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-那家伙打不中我
Dialogue: 1,1:03:32.89,1:03:34.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-to get a favor out of you?   -That guy couldn't hit me
Dialogue: 2,1:03:34.18,1:03:36.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-再加一把米。  -我是 说，你听着像什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.18,1:03:36.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-with a handful of rice.   -I mean, what does that sound like to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:36.35,1:03:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我已经把他牢牢拿捏住了。  -毒贩正要开枪打一个人……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:36.35,1:03:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I had him exactly where I want him.   -A drug dealer was gonna shoot a guy...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:37.60,1:03:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我看见他了，就在那儿。  -……然后我用蛛丝缠住了枪
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.60,1:03:38.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm seein' him right there.   -...then I webbed the gun
Dialogue: 2,1:03:39.06,1:03:40.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-把毒贩手里的枪……  -我完全知道自己
Dialogue: 1,1:03:39.06,1:03:40.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-out of the drug dealer's hand...   -I Know exactly what
Dialogue: 2,1:03:40.19,1:03:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-愿意做什么。  -……又把那毒贩踹回……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:40.19,1:03:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm completely up for.   -...and then kicked that drug dealer...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:41.57,1:03:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-好吧，行，你继续。  -……踹回储物箱里。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:41.57,1:03:42.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Okay, fine, go ahead.   -...back into a storage container.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:42.78,1:03:44.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你管那叫什么？  -你听着像什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:42.78,1:03:44.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What would you call that?   -What does that sound like to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:45.45,1:03:46.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不在乎。我只想回家。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:45.45,1:03:46.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't care. I just wanna go home.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:47.53,1:03:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这主意真棒。滚远点。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:47.53,1:03:49.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's an excellent idea. Kick rocks.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:49.83,1:03:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-回家。不，不，等等，等等。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:49.83,1:03:50.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Go home. No, no, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:50.99,1:03:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}弗兰克，弗兰克， 弗兰克，等等。 求你 了。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.99,1:03:52.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Frank, Frank, Frank, wait. Please.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:53.66,1:03:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我得保护她，明白吗？ 我也没别的地方可去。
Dialogue: 1,1:03:53.66,1:03:57.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have got to keep her safe, okay? And I don't have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:01.25,1:04:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你喜欢吃辣椒吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.25,1:04:02.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You like chili?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:03.51,1:04:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我做了辣肉酱。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.51,1:04:04.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I made chili.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:06.30,1:04:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧。只是……
Dialogue: 1,1:04:06.30,1:04:07.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right. Just...
Dialogue: 2,1:04:08.14,1:04:09.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心阔剑地雷。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:08.14,1:04:09.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}watch out for the claymores.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:09.35,1:04:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我可不想接下来两周都在捡你的碎块。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:09.35,1:04:11.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't wanna pick up pieces of you for the next two weeks.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:13.39,1:04:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，那碗辣肉酱我绝对不吃。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:13.39,1:04:15.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, I definitely would not eat that chili.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以你是说，那个疯子
Dialogue: 1,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So, you telling me that maniac
Dialogue: 2,1:04:19.23,1:04:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞出那些坦克破事的 就 他妈是个十几岁的孩子？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:19.23,1:04:22.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}behind all that tank nonsense is nothing but a goddamn teenager?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:22.65,1:04:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不光是那辆坦克还有过去一个月里
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.65,1:04:23.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And it's not just the tank,
Dialogue: 2,1:04:23.82,1:04:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}针对损害控制局的每次袭击
Dialogue: 1,1:04:23.82,1:04:26.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}it's every attack on Damage Control this past month.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:26.49,1:04:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那小孩是怎么学会开坦克的？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.49,1:04:28.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And how does a kid learn how to drive a tank?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:28.49,1:04:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道，弗兰克。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.49,1:04:29.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:29.74,1:04:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就那样把你从街头揍到街尾。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:29.74,1:04:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Beat your ass all over the street like that.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:31.37,1:04:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她才没把我打趴下。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:31.37,1:04:32.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She did not beat my ass.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:32.45,1:04:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:32.45,1:04:33.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Eh.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:33.70,1:04:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是你家人？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:33.70,1:04:34.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This your family?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能不能离那玩意儿远点？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Would you get the hell away from that?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.25,1:04:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，这家里我就一条规矩。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.25,1:04:42.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, I got one rule in this house.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:42.54,1:04:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么都别碰。什么都别动。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:42.54,1:04:45.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You don't touch anything. You don't move anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:45.38,1:04:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你他妈什么破事都别来问我。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.38,1:04:48.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You sure as shit don't ask me any goddamn questions about anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:49.97,1:04:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-所以，就三条规矩？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:49.97,1:04:51.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-So, three rules?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:54.26,1:04:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我懂你为什么喜欢她了。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:54.26,1:04:55.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I see why you like her.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:56.68,1:04:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我去穿条裤子。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:56.68,1:04:58.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll go put some pants on.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:59.56,1:05:01.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-别碰那锅辣肉酱。
Dialogue: 1,1:04:59.56,1:05:01.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Don't touch the chili.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:02.82,1:05:03.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我喜欢他。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:02.82,1:05:03.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I like him.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:04.65,1:05:05.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你当然会。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:04.65,1:05:05.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:07.28,1:05:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以我成功从HUD里 提取了 这张图 又用系统处理了一遍
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.28,1:05:10.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So I managed to pull this image from my HUD and run it through the system.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:15.16,1:05:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}直到两个月前，都没人。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:15.16,1:05:17.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Until a couple months ago, nobody.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:18.54,1:05:21.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在寄养家庭、精神病院进进出出，
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.54,1:05:21.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She was in and out of foster care, psych hospitals,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:21.17,1:05:23.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}最后她逃走了，从此销声匿迹。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:21.17,1:05:23.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and then eventually she ran away and dropped off the grid.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:23.54,1:05:25.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她的资料几乎全被抹掉了。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:23.54,1:05:25.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There's hardly any information about her that hasn't been scrubbed.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:25.67,1:05:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但她被归类为心灵感应者。 现在我们知道名字了。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:25.67,1:05:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But she's classified as a telepath. And now we have a name.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:33.47,1:05:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}"琴·格蕾。"
Dialogue: 1,1:05:33.47,1:05:34.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}"Jean Grey."
Dialogue: 2,1:05:36.43,1:05:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:36.43,1:05:37.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:37.39,1:05:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这些是她还没袭击的 损害控制局据点，
Dialogue: 1,1:05:37.39,1:05:40.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}These are the Damage Control sites that she hasn't hit yet,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:40.23,1:05:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以她要是露面，
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.23,1:05:41.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}so if she surfaces,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:41.73,1:05:43.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的人脸追踪程序就能找到她。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.73,1:05:43.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}then my facial tracking program will pick her up.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:44.73,1:05:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:44.73,1:05:45.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:45.90,1:05:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，是吗？那又怎样？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.90,1:05:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah? What then?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:49.70,1:05:51.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，别担心"接下来怎么办"。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.70,1:05:51.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, don't worry about "what then."
Dialogue: 2,1:05:51.53,1:05:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-照顾好她就行。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.53,1:05:52.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Just look after her.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:52.49,1:05:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别担心了，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.49,1:05:54.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't worry about it, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:54.12,1:05:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我就该坐这儿替你照看女朋友？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.12,1:05:56.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm just supposed to sit here and babysit your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:56.12,1:05:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我不用人看着， 没错。  -她不是我女朋 友。
Dialogue: 1,1:05:56.12,1:05:57.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I don't need to be babysat, so yeah.   -She's not my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:57.95,1:06:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了，好了。 说吧，有什么计划啊？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.95,1:06:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right, all right. Look, what's the plan, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:00.25,1:06:03.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你就指望你的面部追踪程序管用？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:00.25,1:06:03.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just gonna hope that your facial tracking program works?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:03.88,1:06:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你要是把自己害死了， 我下半辈子就得照顾她？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:03.88,1:06:06.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you get yourself killed, I gotta watch her the rest of my life?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:06.17,1:06:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我死不了，弗兰克。 我能接住她，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.17,1:06:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not gonna get killed, Frank. I can catch her, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:08.51,1:06:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我只是……
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.51,1:06:09.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I just...
Dialogue: 2,1:06:09.59,1:06:12.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只要修好我的抑制器就能行动了。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:09.59,1:06:12.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I just have to fix my inhibitor and then I'll be good to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:12.68,1:06:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你需要什么才能办到？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:12.68,1:06:14.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, what do you need to do that?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:15.47,1:06:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}弗兰克。 你没有我做那事 需要的东西。 明白吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:15.47,1:06:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Frank. You do not have what I need to do that, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:20.56,1:06:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你这嘴可真够欠的。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:20.56,1:06:21.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know you've got some mouth on you.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:22.06,1:06:23.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你怎么想的？你有防静电垫，
Dialogue: 1,1:06:22.06,1:06:23.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you think, you have an anti-static mat,
Dialogue: 2,1:06:24.06,1:06:25.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}音频探针，还有微型工具？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:24.06,1:06:25.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}a tonal probe, and micro tools?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:26.36,1:06:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那些破玩意儿我都有。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.36,1:06:27.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got all that shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:28.32,1:06:29.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为了什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.32,1:06:29.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What for?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:29.40,1:06:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-炸弹。  -猜对了。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:29.40,1:06:30.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Bombs.   -Bingo.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:32.32,1:06:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真不敢信。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.32,1:06:34.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:46.34,1:06:48.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，要不给谁打个电话，你觉得安全吗
Dialogue: 1,1:06:46.34,1:06:48.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, do you think it's safe to maybe call someone
Dialogue: 2,1:06:48.63,1:06:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再告诉他们我没事？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.63,1:06:50.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and let them know I'm okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:52.76,1:06:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:06:52.76,1:06:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:06:54.76,1:06:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}比如你男朋友？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.76,1:06:55.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:56.68,1:06:59.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，不是。像我室友那样。
Dialogue: 1,1:06:56.68,1:06:59.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mmm, no. Like my roommate.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:59.85,1:07:01.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.85,1:07:01.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, um...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得这主意不太好， 你懂吧，因为……
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't think that's such a good idea, you know, because...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:06.86,1:07:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她已经知道他是谁了，
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.86,1:07:08.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}she already knows who he is,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:08.44,1:07:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且她想附谁的身都行，所以……
Dialogue: 1,1:07:08.44,1:07:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and she can inhabit anyone she wants, so...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:10.32,1:07:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。是啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:10.32,1:07:11.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:11.49,1:07:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对对对，你说得对。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.49,1:07:12.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, yeah, yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:12.86,1:07:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-抱歉。不，没事。我完全理解。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:12.86,1:07:15.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-SOrry. No, it's fine. I totally get it.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:17.70,1:07:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是我给男朋友打电话，
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.70,1:07:18.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If I called my boyfriend,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:19.91,1:07:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他只会问我一堆我答不上来的问题，
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.91,1:07:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}he'd just ask me a bunch of questions that I couldn't answer,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:22.16,1:07:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后他就会说我又不肯敞开心扉。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:22.16,1:07:25.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and then he'd tell me I was being withholding again.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:25.67,1:07:27.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}瞒着不说？对。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:25.67,1:07:27.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Withholding? Yep.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:27.67,1:07:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看来你男朋友有点混蛋。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:27.67,1:07:29.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sounds like your boyfriend's kind of a jerk.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:32.34,1:07:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可他为什么觉得你有所隐瞒？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:32.34,1:07:33.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But why'd he think you're withholding?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:34.47,1:07:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。 帘子后的 蒙面义警，你说呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:34.47,1:07:38.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know. You tell me, masked vigilante behind the curtain.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:39.18,1:07:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:07:39.18,1:07:40.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:40.60,1:07:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，我懂你的意思了。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:40.60,1:07:42.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, I see your point.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.27,1:07:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.27,1:07:45.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So what about you?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:45.98,1:07:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那我呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:45.98,1:07:46.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What about me?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:47.94,1:07:51.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你有蜘蛛侠夫人吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:47.94,1:07:51.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, do you have a Mrs. Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:53.32,1:07:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我有蜘蛛侠夫人吗？呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:07:53.32,1:07:55.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do I have a Mrs. Spider-Man? Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:59.12,1:08:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。不。
Dialogue: 1,1:07:59.12,1:08:00.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. No.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:01.83,1:08:02.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为什么不行？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:01.83,1:08:02.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why not?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:03.00,1:08:04.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为什么不行？因为我……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:03.00,1:08:04.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why not? Because I'm...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:06.42,1:08:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}显然，我太藏着掖着了。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:06.42,1:08:08.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm too withholding, obviously.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:09.34,1:08:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-欢迎加入俱乐部。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.34,1:08:11.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Welcome to the club.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:17.43,1:08:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}曾经有个人。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:17.43,1:08:18.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There was someone.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:19.85,1:08:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的？-对，对，对。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:19.85,1:08:21.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Really?   -Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:24.23,1:08:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:24.23,1:08:25.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What happened?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:26.06,1:08:27.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我，呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:26.06,1:08:27.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I, uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:28.73,1:08:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不得不让她走。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:28.73,1:08:30.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I had to let her go.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:31.48,1:08:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}为了保护她。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.48,1:08:32.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}To keep her safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:36.90,1:08:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抱歉，那一定很难熬。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:36.90,1:08:38.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry. That must have been really hard for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:40.32,1:08:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，那时是。对。现在也是。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:40.32,1:08:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, it was. Yeah. It is.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:43.41,1:08:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的很难。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:43.41,1:08:44.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It is really hard.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:46.79,1:08:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哦。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.79,1:08:48.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:48.83,1:08:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你还好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:48.83,1:08:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。嗯，嗯，我没事。我，呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, I'm okay. I, uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样吧，我直接过去。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know what, I'm just gonna come over.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:52.67,1:08:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，等等，等等，等等，等等，等等。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:52.67,1:08:54.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:56.47,1:08:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-怎么回事？呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:56.47,1:08:57.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What's going on? Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:57.55,1:08:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它老是过热。
Dialogue: 1,1:08:57.55,1:08:59.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It just keeps overheating on me.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:00.22,1:09:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这事难住我好几天了。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:00.22,1:09:01.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's been stumping me for days.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:02.68,1:09:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}转学航空航天之前，
Dialogue: 1,1:09:02.68,1:09:03.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Before I switched to aerospace,
Dialogue: 2,1:09:03.85,1:09:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我本想主修生化工程。 所以，我能不能……
Dialogue: 1,1:09:03.85,1:09:07.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I was gonna major in biochemical engineering, so, do you mind if I...
Dialogue: 2,1:09:07.89,1:09:09.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对，当然。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.89,1:09:09.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:09.23,1:09:10.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}给你。拿着。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:09.23,1:09:10.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Here. There you go.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:14.52,1:09:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:14.52,1:09:15.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wow.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:18.57,1:09:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那这设备本身会……
Dialogue: 1,1:09:18.57,1:09:20.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So, does the device itself...
Dialogue: 2,1:09:20.70,1:09:24.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，它会产生什么辐射 或磁场吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.70,1:09:24.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, does it generate any kind of radiation or a magnetic field?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:24.45,1:09:25.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为那样肯定会造成干扰。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:24.45,1:09:25.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}'Cause that would definitely interfere.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:26.04,1:09:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对，它有个微型磁场，
Dialogue: 1,1:09:26.04,1:09:27.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah, it has a micro magnetic field,
Dialogue: 2,1:09:28.04,1:09:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但我设计时就考虑到了这点。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:28.04,1:09:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but I accounted for that in the design.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:30.08,1:09:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，那你的战衣呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:30.08,1:09:31.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, well, what about your suit?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:32.04,1:09:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，它还真渗进布料里了，
Dialogue: 1,1:09:32.04,1:09:33.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, it actually dissipates into the fabric,
Dialogue: 2,1:09:33.96,1:09:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这还挺酷的。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:33.96,1:09:35.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}which is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:36.34,1:09:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:36.34,1:09:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:40.38,1:09:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那些呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:40.38,1:09:41.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What about those?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:42.64,1:09:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:42.64,1:09:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What about what?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:46.22,1:09:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你的护目镜，随你怎么叫。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:46.22,1:09:48.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Your goggles, or whatever you call 'em.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:48.85,1:09:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，他们会造出一个场。 会非常小，不过……
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.85,1:09:52.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, they would create a field. It would be tiny, but...
Dialogue: 2,1:09:54.19,1:09:56.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可它在你头上， 离抑制器很近。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:54.19,1:09:56.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But it's on your head, which is very close to the inhibitor.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:56.61,1:09:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可能就是这才导致它过热。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:56.61,1:09:58.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Which is probably why it's overheating.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:58.94,1:10:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊，MJ，太绝了。
Dialogue: 1,1:09:58.94,1:10:00.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, MJ, that is genius.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:02.57,1:10:03.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，这次一定得成功。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:02.57,1:10:03.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, this has to work.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:06.74,1:10:09.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抑制器已启动。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.74,1:10:09.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Inhibitor engaged.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:11.04,1:10:13.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抑制特定蛛形纲激素
Dialogue: 1,1:10:11.04,1:10:13.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Suppressing selected arachnid hormones.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:14.75,1:10:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好了。感觉好多了。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:14.75,1:10:16.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. That feels better.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:16.84,1:10:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}感觉好多了。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:16.84,1:10:18.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That feels totally better.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:18.72,1:10:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，我脑子好清醒。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:18.72,1:10:21.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my head feels so clear.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:21.51,1:10:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蛛丝，蛛丝。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:21.51,1:10:22.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Web, web.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:22.84,1:10:24.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且我射出的不是有机蛛丝。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.84,1:10:24.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I'm not shooting organic webs.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:25.01,1:10:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪，Mu，真的完全管用！
Dialogue: 1,1:10:25.01,1:10:27.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, my God, Mu, that, like, totally worked.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:28.31,1:10:30.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道，你在这儿搞的东西真够猛的。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:28.31,1:10:30.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, this is some really intense stuff you're working on here.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:33.65,1:10:35.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，对，这真的很重要。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:33.65,1:10:35.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, yeah, it's really important.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:37.77,1:10:41.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，可这就像……我是说， 这就像在改变你的DNA。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:37.77,1:10:41.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, but this is like, I mean, this is like altering your DNA.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:42.70,1:10:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，就是你会穿的那种，比如，
Dialogue: 1,1:10:42.70,1:10:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, this is the kind of stuff you put on, like,
Dialogue: 2,1:10:44.45,1:10:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道，像个怪物。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:44.45,1:10:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't Know, like a monster.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:48.41,1:10:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，要是你看到了我的遭遇
Dialogue: 1,1:10:48.41,1:10:50.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, if you've seen what's been happening to me
Dialogue: 2,1:10:50.16,1:10:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}过去这两天，那你也许就明白了。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:50.16,1:10:52.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}over the last couple days, then you might understand.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:53.58,1:10:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是啊，我这几个小时都跟你在一起
Dialogue: 1,1:10:53.58,1:10:55.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, well, I've been with you for the last few hours
Dialogue: 2,1:10:55.08,1:10:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可我看到的不是这样。
Dialogue: 1,1:10:55.08,1:10:56.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and that's not what I've seen.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你看到了什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And what have you seen?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:59.38,1:11:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}从我所在的帘子这边看？
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.38,1:11:00.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}From my side of the curtain?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:02.63,1:11:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}一个大好人，也许正在改变。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:02.63,1:11:06.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A really good guy who might just be changing.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.27,1:11:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那个，我不是想多管闲事。 那，呃，你接着忙吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:11.27,1:11:14.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, I don't mean to overstep. I'll, uh, let you get back to it.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:36.29,1:11:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你也睡不着啊？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:36.29,1:11:37.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can't sleep either, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:38.38,1:11:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要喝咖啡吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:38.38,1:11:39.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You want coffee?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:40.25,1:11:41.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}当然。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:40.25,1:11:41.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sure.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:42.51,1:11:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你那破玩意儿修好了？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:42.51,1:11:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You get your shit fixed?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:44.68,1:11:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对啊。我一整晚都穿着它。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:44.68,1:11:47.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. I've been wearing it all night.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:47.47,1:11:48.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}目前一切顺利。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:47.47,1:11:48.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So far, So good.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:49.47,1:11:51.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}另外这个，我做成通用的了。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:49.47,1:11:51.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I made this other one universal.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.31,1:11:55.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以要是能把它戴到琴身上， 应该就能彻底封住她的能力。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:51.31,1:11:55.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So if I could get it on Jean, it should completely shut down her powers.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:55.85,1:11:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。你知道还有什么管用吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:55.85,1:11:58.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm. You know what else would work?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:58.40,1:11:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你就朝她开枪。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:58.40,1:11:59.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You just shoot her.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:59.82,1:12:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不错。
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.82,1:12:00.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Nice.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.69,1:12:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的天。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:03.69,1:12:04.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:05.57,1:12:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我这辈子没见过这么傻逼的玩意。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.57,1:12:08.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That has gotta be the goofiest shit I ever seen in my life.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:08.66,1:12:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}怎么，连喝杯咖啡都不能摘面罩？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:08.66,1:12:11.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What, you can't even take the mask off to drink a cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:12.95,1:12:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别往心里去，弗兰克。 见谁都不摘。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:12.95,1:12:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't take it personally, Frank. It stays on for everybody.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:17.00,1:12:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}连她也？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:17.00,1:12:18.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Even her?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:20.50,1:12:21.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她是谁，小子？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.50,1:12:21.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who is she, kid?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:22.80,1:12:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿！扯淡。她是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:22.80,1:12:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Eh! That's horseshit. Who is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.92,1:12:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我说了，我不知道她是谁。  -你在干什么？你在乎她。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.92,1:12:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I'm telling you, I don't Know who she is.   -What are you doin'? You care about her.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:27.38,1:12:28.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你装作不在乎。为什 么？  -我不在乎她。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:27.38,1:12:28.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You're pretending not to. Why?   -I don't care about her.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:28.68,1:12:30.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，弗兰克。 我不 知道她是谁，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:28.68,1:12:30.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, I don't know who she is, Frank. Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:30.60,1:12:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我身边一个人也没有。 我跟 你一样。 总是独来独往。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:30.60,1:12:33.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't have anybody. I'm like you. I just keep to myself.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:33.43,1:12:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你跟我一样？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:33.43,1:12:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're like me?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:35.81,1:12:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小子，你对我了解多少？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:35.81,1:12:37.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you know about me, kid?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:38.15,1:12:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为这能选吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:38.15,1:12:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You think this is a choice?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这么过日子，算一种生活 方式？ 你是这么想的？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Living like this, it's a lifestyle? Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:42.77,1:12:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小子，这是个句子。
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.77,1:12:44.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Kid, this is a sentence.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:45.44,1:12:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗……
Dialogue: 1,1:12:45.44,1:12:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know somethin'...
Dialogue: 2,1:12:47.24,1:12:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是我有一秒，
Dialogue: 1,1:12:47.24,1:12:48.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If I had one second,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:49.62,1:12:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我爱的人要是还活着， 你觉得我会躲在面具后面？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:49.62,1:12:52.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}people I love were still breathing, you think I'd be hiding behind a mask?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:53.41,1:12:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为我会假扮成别人，
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.41,1:12:55.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You think I'd pretend to be something that I'm not,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.66,1:12:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}像个他妈的懦夫一样？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:55.66,1:12:57.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}acting like a goddamn coward?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:03.04,1:13:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}人脸匹配上了。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:03.04,1:13:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got a facial match.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:08.55,1:13:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在曼哈顿的损害控制局总部。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:08.55,1:13:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's at the Damage Control HQ in Manhattan.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我得走了。好。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I gotta go. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她会没事的。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:18.64,1:13:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我会处理的。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.64,1:13:19.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll see to it.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:22.81,1:13:23.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢了，弗兰克。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:22.81,1:13:23.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:30.70,1:13:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:30.70,1:13:31.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:34.95,1:13:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你就让他一个人去？
Dialogue: 1,1:13:34.95,1:13:36.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You just gonna let him go by himself?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:38.04,1:13:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，我觉得他可能需要你。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.04,1:13:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, I think he might need you.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:39.92,1:13:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:39.92,1:13:41.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Eh.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:42.34,1:13:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就像你在斯塔滕岛需要他那样。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:42.34,1:13:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Kinda like you needed him on Staten Island.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:47.96,1:13:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:13:47.96,1:13:49.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:26.42,1:14:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你躲不了我一辈子，Bill。
Dialogue: 1,1:14:26.42,1:14:28.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You can't hide from me forever, Bill.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:29.09,1:14:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你的门很结实， 可你该担心的是墙。
Dialogue: 1,1:14:29.09,1:14:32.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You've got a strong door, but it's the wall you have to worry about.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:33.34,1:14:34.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是谁？你想干什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:14:33.34,1:14:34.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Who are you and what do you want?
Dialogue: 2,1:14:40.10,1:14:41.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是琴·格蕾……
Dialogue: 1,1:14:40.10,1:14:41.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm Jean Grey...
Dialogue: 2,1:14:42.44,1:14:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你也知道我想要什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:14:42.44,1:14:44.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and you know what I want.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:44.71,1:15:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:44.71,1:15:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:46.50,1:15:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你查过我？我都脸红了。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:46.50,1:15:49.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You looked me up? I'm blushing.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:50.42,1:15:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我说过，你要是挡我的路， 你女朋友会有什么下场。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:50.42,1:15:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I told you what would happen to your girl if you got in my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:53.76,1:15:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你别想再靠近她。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:53.76,1:15:55.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're not getting near her again.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:55.97,1:15:58.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你绝对别想进那个金库。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:55.97,1:15:58.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you're definitely not getting inside that vault.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:58.60,1:15:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，也许不是。
Dialogue: 1,1:15:58.60,1:15:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm, maybe not.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:07.06,1:16:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但这家伙可能会。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:07.06,1:16:08.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But this guy might.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:11.19,1:16:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，你不知道自己面对的是什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.19,1:16:13.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, you don't know what you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:13.94,1:16:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，你和班纳有很多共同点。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:13.94,1:16:16.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, you and Banner have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:16.78,1:16:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你们俩都在对抗体内的 怪物， 却毫无胜算。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:16.78,1:16:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Both fighting a losing battle against the monster that lives inside you.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:21.37,1:16:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，这是浩克，你不能就这么……
Dialogue: 1,1:16:21.37,1:16:23.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, this is the Hulk, you can't just...
Dialogue: 2,1:16:31.84,1:16:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.84,1:16:34.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the hell?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:34.26,1:16:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，明白了。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:34.26,1:16:36.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:38.14,1:16:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}想让我也像你一样闭嘴？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.14,1:16:41.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Trying to muzzle me like you muzzle yourself?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:41.60,1:16:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不能让你进去。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:41.60,1:16:43.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't let you in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.18,1:16:45.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不管V-Max是什么，你都别想拿到。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.18,1:16:45.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whatever V-Max is, you're not getting it.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谁说我不是？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like hell I'm not.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:47.31,1:16:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}糟了。
Dialogue: 1,1:16:47.31,1:16:48.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:00.99,1:17:02.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，别这样。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:00.99,1:17:02.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, don't do this.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-别费口舌了。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Save your breath.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:24.89,1:17:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[枪械咔哒响]
Dialogue: 1,1:17:24.89,1:17:26.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}IGUN CLICKS]
Dialogue: 2,1:17:29.94,1:17:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}弗兰克，你怎么在这儿？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:29.94,1:17:31.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Frank, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:31.86,1:17:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为我在干嘛？我在救你的小命。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.86,1:17:33.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What you think I'm doing? I'm saving your ass.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:33.52,1:17:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这事远不是你能管的，哥们。
Dialogue: 1,1:17:33.52,1:17:35.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This is way above your pay grade, dude.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:35.65,1:17:36.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我们在跟浩克打。  -我操！
Dialogue: 1,1:17:35.65,1:17:36.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-We're fighting the Hulk.   -Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:59.72,1:18:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:59.72,1:18:00.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Really?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:03.26,1:18:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-[倒吸气，喘气]
Dialogue: 1,1:18:03.26,1:18:05.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,1:18:11.56,1:18:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 滚出去！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:11.56,1:18:14.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- Get out!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:20.36,1:18:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别再朝他开枪了！ -你他妈疯了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:20.36,1:18:22.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Stop shooting him!   -Are you out of your goddamn mind?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:22.95,1:18:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他……班纳不是问题！她才是。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.95,1:18:25.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He's... Banner's not the problem! She is.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:38.88,1:18:40.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不是叫你待在家看着MJ吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.88,1:18:40.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I thought I told you to stay home and watch MJ.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:40.67,1:18:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，你确实做了。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:40.67,1:18:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:41.84,1:18:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后她跟我说，我得过来看你。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:41.84,1:18:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And then she tells me I gotta come watch you.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:45.05,1:18:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，她真跟你那么说的？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.05,1:18:46.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, did she actually say that to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:46.68,1:18:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你脸红了，水仙花？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:46.68,1:18:48.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Are you blushing, daffodil?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:49.73,1:18:50.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我才没脸红。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:49.73,1:18:50.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not blushing.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:52.81,1:18:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}妈的。我就知道该带把更大的枪。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:52.81,1:18:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Goddamn it. I knew I should have brought a bigger gun.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:55.61,1:18:56.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这主意不错，“带把更大的枪。”
Dialogue: 1,1:18:55.61,1:18:56.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's a good idea, "Bring a bigger gun."
Dialogue: 2,1:18:56.90,1:18:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你想干吗，挠痒痒挠死他？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.90,1:18:58.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What are you gonna do, tickle him to death?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:58.15,1:18:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，听着，计划变了。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:58.15,1:18:59.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. Look, change of plan.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:59.57,1:19:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}先把这东西装到浩克身上， 再去找琴。
Dialogue: 1,1:18:59.57,1:19:02.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}First, we get this on the Hulk, then we go after Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:02.36,1:19:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我有个更好的。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:02.36,1:19:03.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got one better.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:03.61,1:19:05.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是造成伤亡最多的威胁。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:03.61,1:19:05.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's the highest casualty-producing threat.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:05.57,1:19:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你控制住它。 我去找源头。 我来解决它。 明白了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:05.57,1:19:08.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You contain it. I go find the source. I take it down. You got it?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你就是想躲着不跟浩克打吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Are you just trying to get out of fighting the Hulk?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:12.92,1:19:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我想是吧。行吧，随你，哥们。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:12.92,1:19:14.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I guess so. Okay, whatever, dude.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:14.50,1:19:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}交给我。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:14.50,1:19:15.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got this.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:16.08,1:19:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-等等，不，弗兰克，弗兰克！  -什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:16.08,1:19:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Wait, no, Frank, Frank, Frank.   -What?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:17.88,1:19:19.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别杀她！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:17.88,1:19:19.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do not kill her!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:19.21,1:19:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别一上来就扯那套软绵绵的屁话。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:19.21,1:19:21.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't start with that soft serve bullshit.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:21.46,1:19:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗？ 这事我会按自己的方式来。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:21.46,1:19:23.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know something? I'm gonna do this, I'm gonna do it my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:23.38,1:19:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快……快走，快走。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:23.38,1:19:25.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just... just go, just go.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:25.84,1:19:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有，别靠近33英尺内！呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:19:25.84,1:19:28.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And don't get within feet! Enh...
Dialogue: 2,1:19:28.14,1:19:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真让人抓狂。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:28.14,1:19:29.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So frustrating.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:44.36,1:19:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:44.36,1:19:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:49.87,1:19:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:49.87,1:19:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:51.24,1:19:53.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这家伙有毛病。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:51.24,1:19:53.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This guy's got issues.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:54.92,1:19:57.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。哦，不。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:54.92,1:19:57.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，别再来了。哦，不。
Dialogue: 1,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, not again. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:01.30,1:20:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}班纳博士？是你吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:01.30,1:20:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dr. Banner? Is that you?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:03.92,1:20:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠。怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:03.92,1:20:07.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man. What happened?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:07.09,1:20:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:07.09,1:20:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where am I?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:08.22,1:20:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，嘿，嘿。 -这些都是我干的？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:08.22,1:20:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hey, hey, hey.   -Did I do all this?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:10.14,1:20:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你…… -我伤到人了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:10.14,1:20:11.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You...   -Did I hurt anyone?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:11.64,1:20:13.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不是你的错。 她在你脑子里。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:11.64,1:20:13.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's not your fault. She was in your mind.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:13.31,1:20:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你当时控制不了自己。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:13.31,1:20:14.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You weren't in control.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:14.23,1:20:16.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我的抑制器丢了。看这儿，这儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:14.23,1:20:16.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I lost my inhibitor. Look here, here.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:16.27,1:20:18.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}全靠它，才没让里面的怪物跑出来。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:16.27,1:20:18.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's the only thing keeping the monster inside.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:18.60,1:20:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，我这儿还有一个。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:18.60,1:20:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's okay. I got another one here.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:19.61,1:20:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我只要你把这个穿上。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:19.61,1:20:20.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I just need you to put this on.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-这是什么？这是通用的。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What is it? It's universal.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:22.32,1:20:23.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这应该对你管用。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:22.32,1:20:23.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It should work on you.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:28.95,1:20:29.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:28.95,1:20:29.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:33.00,1:20:35.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}求你了，先生， 楼里有人。 把它穿上 吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:33.00,1:20:35.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Please, sir, there's people in the building. Just put it on.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:38.17,1:20:40.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:38.17,1:20:40.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:40.34,1:20:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我的头！她好像把哪儿打坏了！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:40.34,1:20:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My head. I think she broke something!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:43.67,1:20:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她还在里面吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:43.67,1:20:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is she still in there?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:44.96,1:20:46.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:44.96,1:20:46.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:46.30,1:20:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是另一个家伙。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:46.30,1:20:47.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's the other guy.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:47.55,1:20:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}布鲁斯？听我说 我能带你出去，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:47.55,1:20:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Bruce? Look, I can get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:50.72,1:20:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我只要你戴上那个抑制器。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:50.72,1:20:52.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I just need you to put that inhibitor on.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:52.26,1:20:53.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-离我远点！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.26,1:20:53.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Get away from me!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:55.27,1:20:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他来了。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:55.27,1:20:56.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He's coming.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:57.27,1:20:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我控制不了。
Dialogue: 1,1:20:57.27,1:20:58.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't control.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:59.31,1:21:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对，你能行，布鲁斯！对，你能行！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:59.31,1:21:01.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yes, you can, Bruce! Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:01.23,1:21:04.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快离开大楼！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:01.23,1:21:04.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get out of the building!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:04.73,1:21:07.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把所有人都带出……
Dialogue: 1,1:21:04.73,1:21:07.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get everyone out of the...
Dialogue: 2,1:21:10.07,1:21:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不！不！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:10.07,1:21:11.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:11.99,1:21:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}班纳，求你了。看着我。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:11.99,1:21:13.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Banner, please. Look at me.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:16.33,1:21:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没有班纳。没有女孩。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:16.33,1:21:19.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No Banner. No girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:20.50,1:21:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只有浩克。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:20.50,1:21:22.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Only Hulk.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:25.80,1:21:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[低吼]
Dialogue: 1,1:21:25.80,1:21:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}IGROWLS]
Dialogue: 2,1:21:32.10,1:21:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没想到你能变得那么大。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:32.10,1:21:33.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I didn't know you could get that big.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:37.98,1:21:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.98,1:21:39.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:39.90,1:21:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}祝你好运，彼得。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:39.90,1:21:41.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Good luck with that, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:49.53,1:21:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你在这儿啊。
Dialogue: 1,1:21:49.53,1:21:51.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}There you are.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:52.99,1:21:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别动。别动……
Dialogue: 1,1:21:52.99,1:21:53.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just hold still. Just hold still...
Dialogue: 2,1:21:57.58,1:21:58.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别走！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:57.58,1:21:58.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Stay!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:07.42,1:22:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天哪。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.42,1:22:08.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.60,1:22:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不准用致命弹药。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:23.60,1:22:24.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No lethal rounds.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:37.62,1:22:39.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在监测引爆倒计时。
Dialogue: 1,1:22:37.62,1:22:39.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Tracking time to detonation.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:08.32,1:23:10.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有九十秒就爆炸了。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:08.32,1:23:10.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ninety seconds to detonation.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:10.23,1:23:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道！我知道！
Dialogue: 1,1:23:10.23,1:23:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know! I know!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:16.87,1:23:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点。快点。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:16.87,1:23:18.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:18.33,1:23:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你的皮怎么这么厚？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:18.33,1:23:19.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why is your skin so thick?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:19.95,1:23:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}抑制器无法附着。
Dialogue: 1,1:23:19.95,1:23:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Inhibitor cannot attach.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:21.20,1:23:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎，得了吧！
Dialogue: 1,1:23:21.20,1:23:22.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:00.49,1:24:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}班纳博士……
Dialogue: 1,1:24:00.49,1:24:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Dr. Banner...
Dialogue: 2,1:24:03.58,1:24:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}求你了。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:03.58,1:24:04.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}please.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:06.17,1:24:07.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}布鲁斯。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:06.17,1:24:07.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Bruce.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:08.50,1:24:10.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是彼得。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:08.50,1:24:10.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:11.21,1:24:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是你的朋友。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:11.21,1:24:12.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:42.20,1:24:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}布鲁斯。
Dialogue: 1,1:24:42.20,1:24:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Bruce.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:02.31,1:25:05.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把枪扔了，不然下一枪打你脑袋。
Dialogue: 1,1:25:02.31,1:25:05.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Throw down your guns, or you'll get the next one in the head.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:16.40,1:25:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,1:25:16.40,1:25:17.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:31.29,1:25:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你做了什么……
Dialogue: 1,1:25:31.29,1:25:32.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What did you...
Dialogue: 2,1:25:32.38,1:25:33.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}结束了，琴。
Dialogue: 1,1:25:32.38,1:25:33.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's over, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:48.94,1:25:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}萨拉。
Dialogue: 1,1:25:48.94,1:25:49.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sara.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:01.24,1:26:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是我的枪吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:01.24,1:26:02.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is that my gun?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:11.38,1:26:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人受伤吗？就我一个？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:11.38,1:26:14.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is anyone hurt? It's just me?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:15.04,1:26:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人受伤吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:15.04,1:26:16.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Is anyone hurt?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:17.88,1:26:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠……
Dialogue: 1,1:26:17.88,1:26:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man...
Dialogue: 2,1:26:21.64,1:26:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你救了我的命。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:21.64,1:26:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:23.64,1:26:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你还救了不知多少条人命
Dialogue: 1,1:26:23.64,1:26:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you saved God knows how many lives
Dialogue: 2,1:26:25.30,1:26:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}确保她在里面找不到她要找的东西。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:25.30,1:26:27.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}by making sure she didn't find what she was looking for in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:28.06,1:26:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还在里面。看到她过来了。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:28.06,1:26:29.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Still inside. We got her coming through.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:30.52,1:26:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她昏过去前，试着说点什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:30.52,1:26:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Before she passed out, she tried to say something.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:33.52,1:26:36.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}萨拉这个名字，你听着耳熟吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.52,1:26:36.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A name, Sara. Does that mean something to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:37.53,1:26:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在你给她戴上抑制器前，
Dialogue: 1,1:26:37.53,1:26:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Before you got the inhibitor on her,
Dialogue: 2,1:26:40.36,1:26:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她成功侵入了我的意识，只有一瞬间。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:40.36,1:26:42.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}she managed to get in my mind for a moment.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:43.91,1:26:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}萨拉是我关系很近的一位同事， 她最近去世了。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:43.91,1:26:47.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sara was the name of someone I worked closely with that recently passed.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:47.99,1:26:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听到这事，我很难过。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:47.99,1:26:49.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:50.58,1:26:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不知怎么，萨拉的记忆 一定影响了她。
Dialogue: 1,1:26:50.58,1:26:54.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Somehow the memory of Sara must have affected her.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:57.38,1:27:00.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，等她醒了， 我很想跟她聊聊。 可 以吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:57.38,1:27:00.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, I'd love to talk to her when she wakes up, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:00.30,1:27:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}当然。 她会被转到我 们在罗斯福岛的设施。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:00.30,1:27:04.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Of course. She'll be transferred to our facility on Roosevelt Island.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:04.34,1:27:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在，我跟你一样急着让她开口，
Dialogue: 1,1:27:04.34,1:27:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now, I'm just as eager to get her talking as you are,
Dialogue: 2,1:27:06.76,1:27:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过一天内别让她太累。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:06.76,1:27:08.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but let's not strain her too much in one day.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:09.31,1:27:10.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，当然。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:09.31,1:27:10.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:11.14,1:27:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢你，蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.14,1:27:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thank you, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不客气。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:25.49,1:27:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}MJ!
Dialogue: 1,1:27:25.49,1:27:26.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}MJ!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:26.58,1:27:28.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}成功了。她被抓起来了。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:26.58,1:27:28.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It worked. She's in custody.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:28.95,1:27:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你现在安全了。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.95,1:27:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're safe now.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:33.25,1:27:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你落下这个了。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:33.25,1:27:34.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You left this.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:42.55,1:27:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是想让我找到它吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.55,1:27:43.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Did you want me to find it?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:45.93,1:27:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。不。呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:27:45.93,1:27:48.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. No. Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:27:49.01,1:27:50.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听我说，我能解释，我……
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.01,1:27:50.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, I can explain, I...
Dialogue: 2,1:27:50.10,1:27:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}能请你把那个取下来吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:50.10,1:27:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can you take that off, please?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:53.39,1:27:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:53.39,1:27:54.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:55.44,1:27:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}面罩。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:55.44,1:27:56.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The mask.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:58.52,1:28:03.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得我有权 跟"彼 得·帕克"谈这件事。
Dialogue: 1,1:27:58.52,1:28:03.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think I deserve to have this conversation with "Peter Parker."
Dialogue: 2,1:28:29.10,1:28:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}前几天晚上， 你来我 们公寓参加了派对。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:29.10,1:28:30.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You came to the party at our apartment the other night.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:37.52,1:28:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有那家甜甜圈店。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:37.52,1:28:39.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And the donut shop.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:40.94,1:28:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我离家去上学的那年。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:40.94,1:28:42.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The year I went off to school.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:45.15,1:28:46.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你当时为什么不告诉我？
Dialogue: 1,1:28:45.15,1:28:46.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Why didn't you tell me then?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:47.03,1:28:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是想保护你。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:47.03,1:28:48.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I was trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:49.16,1:28:51.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是啊，可过去24小时里， 我差点死了得有五回，
Dialogue: 1,1:28:49.16,1:28:51.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, well, I've almost been killed, like, five times in the past hours,
Dialogue: 2,1:28:52.08,1:28:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以效果不太好。
Dialogue: 1,1:28:52.08,1:28:53.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}so it's not really working that well.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:54.50,1:28:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道。对不起。我……
Dialogue: 1,1:28:54.50,1:28:55.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know. I'm sorry. I...
Dialogue: 2,1:28:57.25,1:28:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你到底打算告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:28:57.25,1:28:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Were you ever gonna tell me?
Dialogue: 2,1:29:05.46,1:29:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:05.46,1:29:06.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Right.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:07.97,1:29:10.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以你就打算替我做决定。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:07.97,1:29:10.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So you just were gonna make that decision for me.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:11.14,1:29:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道。对不起。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:11.14,1:29:12.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:12.35,1:29:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你真不用一直跟我说对不起。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:12.35,1:29:14.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't really need you to keep saying that you're sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:14.31,1:29:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道你想让我说什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:14.31,1:29:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't Know what you want me to tell you.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:15.60,1:29:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要你告诉我，为什么这样对我。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:15.60,1:29:17.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I want you to tell me why you would do this to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:23.61,1:29:24.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我失去了一个人。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:23.61,1:29:24.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I lost someone.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:28.82,1:29:30.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要不是我，他们就还在这儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:28.82,1:29:30.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And they'd still be here if it wasn't for me.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:35.74,1:29:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我没把那封信念给你听，是因为……
Dialogue: 1,1:29:35.74,1:29:37.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I didn't read you that letter because...
Dialogue: 2,1:29:38.66,1:29:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不想让那种事发生在你身上。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:38.66,1:29:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I didn't want anything like that to happen to you.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:41.08,1:29:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但这事可不是你说了算。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:41.08,1:29:42.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But that's not really your decision to make.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:42.38,1:29:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道不是，可……
Dialogue: 1,1:29:42.38,1:29:43.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know it's not, but...
Dialogue: 2,1:29:46.05,1:29:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你就是我的一切。
Dialogue: 1,1:29:46.05,1:29:47.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You mean everything to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:50.64,1:29:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我一直想没你也能活，可我……
Dialogue: 1,1:29:50.64,1:29:53.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I've been trying to live my life without you, but l...
Dialogue: 2,1:29:54.93,1:29:55.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我做不到。
