Dialogue: 1,1:34:37.09,1:34:38.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, I already know how the web shooters work.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:38.72,1:34:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是这样吗？
