Dialogue: 1,1:34:40.05,1:34:43.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, there's obviously some sort of a shear-thinning fluid
Dialogue: 2,1:34:43.22,1:34:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它在腔室里循环， 对吧？ 这样就能保持液 态。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.22,1:34:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that is cycling within a chamber, right? So it can keep its liquid form.
