Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.81,1:34:49.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And then, when you activate it by pressing on the triggers,
Dialogue: 2,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}它流经特氟龙涡轮，
Dialogue: 1,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}it runs through a Teflon turbine,
Dialogue: 2,1:34:50.89,1:34:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后一接触空气就会变硬。 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.89,1:34:54.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and then it hardens when it interacts with the air. Right?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:56.98,1:34:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……也不全是，但……
Dialogue: 1,1:34:56.98,1:34:59.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh... I mean, not exactly, but...
Dialogue: 2,1:34:59.86,1:35:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，好，那告诉我蛛丝液里有啥。
Dialogue: 1,1:34:59.86,1:35:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, okay, well, then tell me what's in the web fluid.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:02.24,1:35:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我猜是长链聚合物之类的。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:02.24,1:35:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I would guess something like a long chain polymer.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:05.24,1:35:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，尼龙？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:05.24,1:35:06.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, nylon?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:06.66,1:35:07.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}挺接近的。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:06.66,1:35:07.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's pretty close.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:07.74,1:35:10.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，好吧。Nomex呢？或者，哦，Kevlar？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:07.74,1:35:10.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay, okay. What about Nomex or, oh, Kevlar?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:13.29,1:35:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[模仿佛罗多] 好吧，那就守着你的秘密。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.29,1:35:15.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}(IMITATES FRODO] "All right, then. Keep your secrets."
Dialogue: 2,1:35:15.21,1:35:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}"如果你指的是那起事件
Dialogue: 1,1:35:15.21,1:35:17.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}"If you're referring to the incident
Dialogue: 2,1:35:17.42,1:35:18.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-和那条龙一起……
Dialogue: 1,1:35:17.42,1:35:18.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-with the dragon..."
Dialogue: 2,1:35:18.42,1:35:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……我几乎没参与。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:18.42,1:35:19.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}"...I was barely involved."
Dialogue: 2,1:35:19.76,1:35:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}"我只是
Dialogue: 1,1:35:19.76,1:35:21.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}"All I did was simply
Dialogue: 2,1:35:21.51,1:35:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}"轻轻推你叔叔一把，让他出门。"
Dialogue: 1,1:35:21.51,1:35:23.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}"give your uncle a little nudge out the door."
Dialogue: 2,1:35:26.01,1:35:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这参考很靠谱。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.01,1:35:27.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Solid reference.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:28.31,1:35:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇，该吃越南三明治了。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:28.31,1:35:30.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ooh, banh mi time.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:30.10,1:35:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你点了越南法棍三明治？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.10,1:35:31.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You ordered banh mis?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:31.56,1:35:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我点了五个越南法棍三明治。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:31.56,1:35:32.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I ordered five banh mis.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:32.85,1:35:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠在我们公寓里， 得给他弄点吃的。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:32.85,1:35:34.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We have Spider-Man in the apartment. He's gonna get fed.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:38.44,1:35:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不好意思啊。 他就是 见你来了，太激动了。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:38.44,1:35:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sorry about him. He's just, like, very excited that you're here.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:41.53,1:35:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}开玩笑吧？ 我都好几 年没这么开心过了。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:41.53,1:35:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You kidding? This is, like, the most fun I've had in years.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:43.95,1:35:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我真的好想你们。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:43.95,1:35:46.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I really missed you guys.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:47.95,1:35:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你们看着真像最好的朋友。
Dialogue: 1,1:35:47.95,1:35:49.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You guys really do look like best friends.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:50.04,1:35:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:50.04,1:35:51.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:00.59,1:36:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你该告诉他。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:00.59,1:36:01.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You should tell him.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:02.34,1:36:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他能应付。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:02.34,1:36:03.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He can handle it.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:05.22,1:36:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是啊，我知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.22,1:36:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:08.93,1:36:09.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:08.93,1:36:09.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:13.35,1:36:16.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在屋顶上附你身的时候，
Dialogue: 1,1:36:13.35,1:36:16.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}When she was inhabiting you on the rooftop,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:18.11,1:36:19.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她亲了我……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:18.11,1:36:19.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}she kissed me...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:20.36,1:36:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也回吻了她，
Dialogue: 1,1:36:20.36,1:36:21.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and I kissed her back,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:22.07,1:36:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为我……我以为是你， 可我不确定。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:22.07,1:36:24.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}because I... I thought it was you, but I didn't Know.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:25.28,1:36:27.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有，我……我真的很抱歉。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:25.28,1:36:27.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I'm... I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:28.45,1:36:29.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我只是觉得该让你知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:28.45,1:36:29.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I just thought you should know.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:32.16,1:36:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢你告诉我。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:32.16,1:36:33.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks for telling me.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:36.79,1:36:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，反正我啥也不记得，所以……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:36.79,1:36:39.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, it's not like I remember anything anyway, So...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:40.96,1:36:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真的？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:40.96,1:36:42.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Really?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:42.13,1:36:44.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对。挺怪的，就像， 上一秒我还坐在书桌前，
Dialogue: 1,1:36:42.13,1:36:44.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. It was weird, it was like, one second I was sitting at my desk,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:45.05,1:36:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}下一秒我就躺在街上了。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:45.05,1:36:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and the next second I was lying on the street.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:47.72,1:36:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}说不清，就像有个开关关了。
Dialogue: 1,1:36:47.72,1:36:49.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know, like a light switch went off.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:51.81,1:36:52.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:51.81,1:36:52.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:52.97,1:36:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}所以你什么都不记得了？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.97,1:36:54.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So you don't remember anything?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:56.39,1:36:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:56.39,1:36:57.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. Why?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:57.48,1:37:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}梅茨格说， 他记得自己想起一个叫萨拉的人，
Dialogue: 1,1:36:57.48,1:37:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Metzger said he remembered thinking about someone named Sara,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:00.52,1:37:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可你是说，你什么都不记得了？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:00.52,1:37:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but what you're saying is that you don't remember anything at all?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，对，就是一瞬间的事。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, yeah, it was instantaneous.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:08.36,1:37:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这才是最吓人的地方。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:08.36,1:37:09.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's what made it so scary.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:11.58,1:37:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他骗了我。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:11.58,1:37:12.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}He lied to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:15.87,1:37:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听说你抓住了leshy。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.87,1:37:17.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I heard you caught leshy.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:17.50,1:37:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，她叫琴·格蕾。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:17.50,1:37:18.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah. Her name's Jean Grey.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:18.88,1:37:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想请人帮忙看看几个土豆有多大。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.88,1:37:21.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I need some help determining the size of some potatoes.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:21.34,1:37:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-土豆？  -我看是黑寡妇。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:21.34,1:37:23.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Potatoes?   -I think that's Black Widow.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:23.21,1:37:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我觉得Metzger在名字上骗了我。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:23.21,1:37:25.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think Metzger lied to me about a name.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:25.26,1:37:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}能查查Jean和一个叫Sa ra的人 有没有联系吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:25.26,1:37:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Can you see if there's a connection between Jean and someone named Sara?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:29.34,1:37:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。这些土豆听着有点少。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:29.34,1:37:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm. These potatoes sound meager.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:33.26,1:37:35.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇，那还真是你的办公室。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:33.26,1:37:35.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, wow. That really is your office.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:35.72,1:37:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哟，哟，哟。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:35.72,1:37:36.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:36.89,1:37:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}互联网，政府档案，
Dialogue: 1,1:37:36.89,1:37:39.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Internet, government records,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:39.35,1:37:44.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有大量琴·格蕾的相关数 据 被损害控制局清除了。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:39.35,1:37:44.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and a lot of data related to Jean Grey has been scrubbed by Damage Control.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:44.15,1:37:45.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哪方面的数据？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:44.15,1:37:45.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Data about what?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:46.11,1:37:47.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她的姐妹。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:46.11,1:37:47.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Her sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:47.82,1:37:49.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，琴有个姐妹？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:47.82,1:37:49.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, Jean has a sister?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:50.86,1:37:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。Sara Grey。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:50.86,1:37:52.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm. Sara Grey.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:52.91,1:37:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}也是个心灵感应者。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:52.91,1:37:54.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Also a telepath.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:54.70,1:37:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}损害控制局把她拘押起来， 以供研究观察。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:54.70,1:37:58.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Damage Control took her into custody for study and observation.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:58.58,1:38:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哇。我是说， 你大概能 猜到他们指的是什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:37:58.58,1:38:00.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wow. I mean, you can probably guess what they mean by that.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:00.92,1:38:03.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}人体实验，还有其他侵犯人权的事。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:00.92,1:38:03.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Experimentation and other human rights violations.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:03.29,1:38:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。对，没错。等等，你是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:03.29,1:38:05.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hmm. Yes, exactly. Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:05.17,1:38:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-嗨。内德·利兹。你 的铁粉。我是……
Dialogue: 1,1:38:05.17,1:38:06.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Hi. Ned Leeds. Big fan. I'm...
Dialogue: 2,1:38:07.01,1:38:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:07.01,1:38:08.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hi.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:08.38,1:38:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}UA，对不起。呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:38:08.38,1:38:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}UA, I'm sorry. Uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:38:09.93,1:38:12.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那个伤心的人有朋友，我真开心。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:09.93,1:38:12.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm just so happy that the sad man has friends.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:15.10,1:38:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢了。我，呃……我欠你个人情。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:15.10,1:38:17.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thanks. I, uh... I owe you one.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:18.43,1:38:19.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}祝你好运，蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:18.43,1:38:19.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Good luck, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:19.81,1:38:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}再见。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:19.81,1:38:20.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Bye.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:20.94,1:38:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她只是在找她姐姐或妹妹
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.94,1:38:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She was just looking for her sister
Dialogue: 2,1:38:22.48,1:38:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我把她交给了那些带走她的人。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:22.48,1:38:24.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and I handed her to the people that took her.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:24.69,1:38:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-我得走了。嘿，彼得……
Dialogue: 1,1:38:24.69,1:38:26.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-I gotta go. Hey, Peter...
Dialogue: 2,1:38:26.36,1:38:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:26.36,1:38:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:28.40,1:38:29.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心点，好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:28.40,1:38:29.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just be careful, all right?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:31.36,1:38:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，我会的。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:31.36,1:38:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:37.20,1:38:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠叫彼得？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:37.20,1:38:38.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man's name is Peter?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:52.55,1:38:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，你想成为什么样的人？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:52.55,1:38:54.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, who do you want to be?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:57.39,1:38:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她。穿粉色外套的。
Dialogue: 1,1:38:57.39,1:38:58.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Her. Pink jacket.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:00.39,1:39:01.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她离得太远了。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:00.39,1:39:01.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's too far.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:02.44,1:39:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得跳一下。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.44,1:39:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're gonna have to hop.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:03.52,1:39:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}跳？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:03.52,1:39:04.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hop?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:04.98,1:39:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}先选个亲近的人。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:04.98,1:39:07.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}First, pick someone close.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:07.69,1:39:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}然后……
Dialogue: 1,1:39:07.69,1:39:08.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And then...
Dialogue: 2,1:39:22.87,1:39:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}每次跳跃都有极限。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:22.87,1:39:23.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Each hop has a limit.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:24.54,1:39:27.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但你可以把它们串起来， 想走多远就走多远。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:24.54,1:39:27.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But you can string them together and go as far as you want.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:28.42,1:39:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-等你松手时……
Dialogue: 1,1:39:28.42,1:39:30.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-And when you let go...
Dialogue: 2,1:39:30.96,1:39:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你又回到原点了。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:30.96,1:39:32.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're right back where you started.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.47,1:39:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你能同时对这座公园里所有人这么做吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:33.47,1:39:35.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Could you do that to everyone in this park at once?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:36.68,1:39:38.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，是啊，也许哪天吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:36.68,1:39:38.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, yeah, maybe one day.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:38.72,1:39:39.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是你变得很厉害。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:38.72,1:39:39.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you get really good.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:53.57,1:39:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她怎么能就这么……
Dialogue: 1,1:39:53.57,1:39:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}How could she just...
Dialogue: 2,1:39:55.82,1:39:56.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要把我们送走？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:55.82,1:39:56.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}send us away?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:58.49,1:39:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她算不上真正的妈妈。
Dialogue: 1,1:39:58.49,1:39:59.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She wasn't really a mom.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:02.04,1:40:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}反正不是那样。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:02.04,1:40:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Not like that, anyway.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:03.21,1:40:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们还没变的时候，她是。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:03.21,1:40:05.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She was, before we changed.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:05.29,1:40:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吧，要是这就能让你不当妈，
Dialogue: 1,1:40:05.29,1:40:07.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, well, if that's all it takes for you to stop being a mom,
Dialogue: 2,1:40:07.21,1:40:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你就不是妈妈。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:07.21,1:40:08.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}then you're not a mom.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:09.13,1:40:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要是有我们这样的女儿，你会怎么办？
Dialogue: 1,1:40:09.13,1:40:11.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What would you do if you had daughters like us?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:11.76,1:40:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我会很喜欢它们的。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:11.76,1:40:12.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'd love them.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:16.43,1:40:18.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-尤其是那个红头发的。  -闭嘴。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:16.43,1:40:18.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Especially the redhead one.   -Shut up.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:20.93,1:40:22.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们还有彼此。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:20.93,1:40:22.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We have each other.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:23.52,1:40:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:23.52,1:40:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Mmm.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们还有冰淇淋。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And we have ice cream.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:29.61,1:40:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-一份薄荷巧克力碎，  -份巧克力？ -对。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:29.61,1:40:30.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-One mint chip, one chocolate?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:37.41,1:40:38.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:37.41,1:40:38.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:39.95,1:40:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在我知道你怎么玩了。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:39.95,1:40:41.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Now I know how you're playing.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:41.62,1:40:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-哦。
Dialogue: 1,1:40:41.62,1:40:43.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:58.97,1:40:59.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}趴下！趴下！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:58.97,1:40:59.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:00.05,1:41:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}趴下！趴下！趴下！趴下！
Dialogue: 1,1:41:00.05,1:41:01.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get down! Get down! Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:01.72,1:41:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}马上趴到地上！趴下！趴下！
Dialogue: 1,1:41:01.72,1:41:03.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get down on the ground now! Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:05.98,1:41:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}莎拉！
Dialogue: 1,1:41:05.98,1:41:06.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sara!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:12.57,1:41:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起，Jean。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:12.57,1:41:13.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}'m sorry, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:14.82,1:41:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我必须保护你。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:14.82,1:41:16.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:29.46,1:41:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[倒吸气，喘气]
Dialogue: 1,1:41:29.46,1:41:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,1:41:58.82,1:42:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}受试者醒了。 心率每分钟94次。
Dialogue: 1,1:41:58.82,1:42:01.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Subject is awake. Heart rate is bpm.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:04.70,1:42:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，这招再也行不通了， 都拜蜘蛛侠所赐。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:04.70,1:42:08.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, that's not gonna work anymore, thanks to Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:11.25,1:42:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:42:11.25,1:42:12.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:22.30,1:42:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你得呼吸。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:22.30,1:42:23.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I need you to breathe.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:23.64,1:42:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要你看着我，呼吸。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:23.64,1:42:25.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I need you to look at me and breathe.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:25.39,1:42:27.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:42:25.39,1:42:27.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.14,1:42:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你安全了。深呼吸。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.14,1:42:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're safe. Breathe.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:31.23,1:42:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在哪？
Dialogue: 1,1:42:31.23,1:42:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:33.81,1:42:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你和你姐姐一样，都有天赐的能力
Dialogue: 1,1:42:33.81,1:42:35.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Like your sister, you've been blessed with a power
Dialogue: 2,1:42:35.82,1:42:38.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那有望给世界带来巨大的好处，
Dialogue: 1,1:42:35.82,1:42:38.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that has the potential to do tremendous good in the world,
Dialogue: 2,1:42:39.36,1:42:40.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}或是巨大的破坏。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:39.36,1:42:40.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}or tremendous damage.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:41.66,1:42:45.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}像你这样的力量， 落在孩子手里， 是承受不起 的重担。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:41.66,1:42:45.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A power like yours in the hands of a child is an impossible burden.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:46.37,1:42:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但想象一下……
Dialogue: 1,1:42:46.37,1:42:47.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But imagine...
Dialogue: 2,1:42:48.58,1:42:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}如果那股力量落到人们手中
Dialogue: 1,1:42:48.58,1:42:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}if that power was placed in the hands of people
Dialogue: 2,1:42:51.08,1:42:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真正知道该怎么用它的人。
Dialogue: 1,1:42:51.08,1:42:52.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}who actually Know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:01.47,1:43:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我姐姐或妹妹在哪？
Dialogue: 1,1:43:01.47,1:43:03.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where is my sister?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:06.10,1:43:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你会改变世界的，琴。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:06.10,1:43:08.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're gonna change the world, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:08.47,1:43:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿！
Dialogue: 1,1:43:08.47,1:43:09.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,1:43:13.85,1:43:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.85,1:43:15.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 2,1:43:32.50,1:43:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-~蜘蛛侠: 弗兰克。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:32.50,1:43:34.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-~SPIDER-MAN: Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:34.33,1:43:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道你在哪，在干什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:34.33,1:43:36.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I Know where you are, what you're doing.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:36.34,1:43:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，是吗？怎么说？
Dialogue: 1,1:43:36.34,1:43:37.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah? And how's that?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:38.09,1:43:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小子，我到处都有眼线。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:38.09,1:43:39.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I got eyes everywhere, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:40.96,1:43:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}听着，弗兰克。 损害控 制局绑架了琴的姐妹。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:40.96,1:43:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look, Frank. Damage Control kidnapped Jean's sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:43.68,1:43:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴只是想找到她。我们全都想错了。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:43.68,1:43:46.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean was just trying to find her. We were wrong about everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:46.22,1:43:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}矫情的屁话。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:46.22,1:43:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sentimental horseshit.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:48.51,1:43:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你见过她的本事，知道她能做什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:43:48.51,1:43:50.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You've seen what she can do and what she's capable of.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:50.68,1:43:53.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么，你要把她放了？ 你就打算这么干？
Dialogue: 1,1:43:50.68,1:43:53.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What, you're gonna let her loose? Is that what you're gonna do?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:54.44,1:43:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我现在就告诉你 你那么 做，我就按我的方式处理
Dialogue: 1,1:43:54.44,1:43:57.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'll tell you right now, you do that, I handle it my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:58.44,1:43:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}弗兰克，求你了，你能不能……
Dialogue: 1,1:43:58.44,1:43:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Frank, please, can you just...
Dialogue: 2,1:43:59.36,1:44:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-呃……
Dialogue: 1,1:43:59.36,1:44:00.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Eh...
Dialogue: 2,1:44:00.28,1:44:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}弗兰克！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.28,1:44:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Frank!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:13.96,1:44:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}测下距离？
Dialogue: 1,1:44:13.96,1:44:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Distance check?
Dialogue: 2,1:44:15.12,1:44:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-净空四十英尺。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:15.12,1:44:16.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Forty-foot clearance.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:16.46,1:44:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在封锁房间。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:16.46,1:44:17.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Locking down the room.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:17.96,1:44:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}正在封锁。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:17.96,1:44:18.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Locking down.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:24.22,1:44:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}关闭抑制器。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:24.22,1:44:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Disengage inhibitor.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:29.76,1:44:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，你的超能力现在完全正常了。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:29.76,1:44:31.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, your powers are now fully operational.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:41.48,1:44:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你也看到了 我们已超出你的跳跃范围
Dialogue: 1,1:44:41.48,1:44:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}As you can tell, we are beyond your jump radius.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:44.94,1:44:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}告诉我V-Max是什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:44.94,1:44:47.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Tell me what V-Max is.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:48.20,1:44:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是第二个问我这事的人。我……
Dialogue: 1,1:44:48.20,1:44:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're the second person to ask me about that. I...
Dialogue: 2,1:44:50.95,1:44:52.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我完全不知道那是什么意思。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:50.95,1:44:52.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have no idea what that means.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:52.58,1:44:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她给我发了条消息。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:52.58,1:44:54.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She sent me a message.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:54.79,1:44:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她当时想帮我找到她。
Dialogue: 1,1:44:54.79,1:44:56.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She was trying to help me find her.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:57.58,1:45:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她隔着那么远，用心灵感应跟你交流？
Dialogue: 1,1:44:57.58,1:45:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She communicated with you telepathically across all that distance?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:01.46,1:45:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那次我们确实记录到大幅飙升。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:01.46,1:45:04.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We did register a huge spike in that session.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:06.34,1:45:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真有意思。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:06.34,1:45:07.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:07.51,1:45:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是什么意思，混蛋？
Dialogue: 1,1:45:07.51,1:45:09.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What does it mean, asshole?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:11.43,1:45:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不知道。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:11.43,1:45:12.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:13.43,1:45:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}开始吧。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:13.43,1:45:14.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:22.94,1:45:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们和Sara的合作主要有两方面，
Dialogue: 1,1:45:22.94,1:45:25.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Our work with Sara centered on two areas,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:25.32,1:45:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}找出她力量的来源
Dialogue: 1,1:45:25.32,1:45:27.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}identifying the source of her power
Dialogue: 2,1:45:27.70,1:45:30.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}并找出复制它的方法。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:27.70,1:45:30.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and identifying a path towards copying it.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:30.28,1:45:32.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-要是我们能找到办法
Dialogue: 1,1:45:30.28,1:45:32.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-If we could find a way
Dialogue: 2,1:45:32.12,1:45:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}记录跳跃时的心灵感应大脑，
Dialogue: 1,1:45:32.12,1:45:34.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}to record a telepathic brain during a jump,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:34.70,1:45:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那也许我们能复制那些通路
Dialogue: 1,1:45:34.70,1:45:37.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}then perhaps we could replicate those pathways
Dialogue: 2,1:45:37.83,1:45:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在我们选定的脑海里。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:37.83,1:45:39.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}in a mind of our choosing.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:41.00,1:45:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这件乐器是你姐妹留下的。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:41.00,1:45:44.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This instrument is your sister's legacy.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:45.26,1:45:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们一起反复摸索了好几 个月， 才做成了这个。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:45.26,1:45:48.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We built this together over many months of trial and error.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:49.38,1:45:51.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}希望你我都不辜负她的牺牲。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:49.38,1:45:51.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I hope you and I can honor her sacrifice.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:54.68,1:45:56.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你在说什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:45:54.68,1:45:56.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:57.52,1:45:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}触发第一次跳跃。
Dialogue: 1,1:45:57.52,1:45:58.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Trigger the first jump.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:03.57,1:46:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}告诉我V-Max是什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:03.57,1:46:06.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Tell me what V-Max is.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:06.15,1:46:07.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道你把她藏在那儿。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:06.15,1:46:07.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know that's where you're hiding her.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:12.12,1:46:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[倒吸气，喘气]
Dialogue: 1,1:46:12.12,1:46:13.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,1:46:23.00,1:46:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在跳。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:23.00,1:46:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's jumping.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:26.30,1:46:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}收到。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:26.30,1:46:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Copy.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:27.84,1:46:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们已进入全面封锁。流程已启动。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:27.84,1:46:30.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We're in full lockdown. Process has commenced.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:30.93,1:46:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么流程？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:30.93,1:46:31.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What process?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:33.39,1:46:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，哇，哥们儿， 你这表情可够严肃的。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:33.39,1:46:35.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, whoa, that's a pretty serious look there, dude.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:36.60,1:46:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，嘿，等等！ 哥们，你搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:36.60,1:46:38.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, hey, whoa! What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:38.22,1:46:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}拜托。我是损害控制局 的朋友。 你干什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:38.22,1:46:40.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on. I'm a friend of Damage Control. What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:43.77,1:46:44.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:43.77,1:46:44.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Huh.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:44.86,1:46:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}要来这套是吧。想打一架？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:44.86,1:46:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's gonna be like that. You wanna go.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:46.52,1:46:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:46.52,1:46:47.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:48.03,1:46:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，等我一下。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:48.03,1:46:49.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}All right, well, just give me a sec.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:50.07,1:46:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等我一下。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:50.07,1:46:51.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:51.95,1:46:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我已经不是高中生了。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:51.95,1:46:53.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not in high school anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:55.66,1:46:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你拉伸吗？很爱拉伸吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:55.66,1:46:57.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Do you stretch? You a big stretcher?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:57.24,1:46:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，你干这行就该这么做。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:57.24,1:46:58.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, you should do in your line of work.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:59.29,1:47:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你呢？你们做拉伸吗？ 对身体可有好处了。
Dialogue: 1,1:46:59.29,1:47:02.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What about you? You guys stretch? It's so good for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:04.04,1:47:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:47:04.04,1:47:05.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You ready?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:05.13,1:47:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 1,1:47:05.13,1:47:07.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 2,1:47:14.68,1:47:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小心碰头！
Dialogue: 1,1:47:14.68,1:47:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Watch your head!
Dialogue: 2,1:47:35.57,1:47:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴·格蕾在哪？
Dialogue: 1,1:47:35.57,1:47:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where is Jean Grey?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:38.37,1:47:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这是第26跳。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:38.37,1:47:40.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's jump 26.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:40.20,1:47:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-录像看着不错。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:40.20,1:47:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Recordings look good.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:41.54,1:47:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}打扰一下，先生。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.54,1:47:42.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:43.58,1:47:44.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有人闯进来了。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:43.58,1:47:44.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We have an intruder.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:49.76,1:47:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你说得对。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:49.76,1:47:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You were right.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:51.05,1:47:53.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她比她的姐妹强多了。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:51.05,1:47:53.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She's much stronger than her sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:54.09,1:47:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}提高频率。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:54.09,1:47:55.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Increase the frequency.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:56.84,1:47:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你做得很好，琴。
Dialogue: 1,1:47:56.84,1:47:58.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're doing very well, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:46.14,1:48:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:46.14,1:48:47.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:48:51.90,1:48:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，听得见我说话吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:51.90,1:48:53.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 2,1:48:59.53,1:49:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:59.53,1:49:00.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:05.12,1:49:06.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是个杀人犯。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:05.12,1:49:06.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're a murderer.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:08.67,1:49:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-她的频率在不断进化。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:08.67,1:49:11.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Her frequencies are evolving.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:11.84,1:49:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这说不通。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:11.84,1:49:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:14.05,1:49:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我妹妹最后看到的就是这间屋子。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:14.05,1:49:18.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The last thing my sister saw was this room.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:18.30,1:49:20.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她的脑电波不知怎么 影响了她周围的物体。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:18.30,1:49:20.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Her brainwaves are somehow affecting the objects around her.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:21.01,1:49:22.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}把它关掉。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:21.01,1:49:22.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:22.10,1:49:23.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我在努力，长官。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:22.10,1:49:23.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm trying, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:23.39,1:49:24.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你说你在努力，什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,1:49:23.39,1:49:24.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean you're trying?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:24.89,1:49:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我姐姐最后看到的 就 是这间该死的屋子！
Dialogue: 1,1:49:24.89,1:49:29.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The last thing my sister saw was this goddamn room!
Dialogue: 2,1:49:30.06,1:49:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-关掉它！  -我做不到，长官。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:30.06,1:49:31.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Shut it down!   -I can't, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:33.02,1:49:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}让开。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:33.02,1:49:34.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Move.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:36.49,1:49:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不能让你这么做，Bill。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:36.49,1:49:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't let you do that, Bill.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:42.12,1:49:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-仅有的双手
Dialogue: 1,1:49:42.12,1:49:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-The only hands
Dialogue: 2,1:49:44.16,1:49:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}将驾驭这股力量的……
Dialogue: 1,1:49:44.16,1:49:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that will wield this power...
Dialogue: 2,1:49:46.25,1:49:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-……是我的。
Dialogue: 1,1:49:46.25,1:49:48.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-...are mine.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:13.44,1:50:15.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,1:50:13.44,1:50:15.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What is happening?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:16.57,1:50:17.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}进去。
Dialogue: 1,1:50:16.57,1:50:17.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Get inside.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:24.91,1:50:25.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等我！
Dialogue: 1,1:50:24.91,1:50:25.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:01.38,1:52:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你…… 你想干什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:52:01.38,1:52:02.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-What... What do you want?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:06.68,1:52:09.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，我是来帮你的。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:06.68,1:52:09.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:10.97,1:52:12.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是你把我弄到这儿的。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:10.97,1:52:12.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You put me here.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:13.02,1:52:14.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道，Sara的事，我很抱歉，
Dialogue: 1,1:52:13.02,1:52:14.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know, and I'm sorry about Sara,
Dialogue: 2,1:52:14.94,1:52:17.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也很抱歉，错得这么离谱。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:14.94,1:52:17.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and I'm sorry that I got it so wrong.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:19.27,1:52:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你要是来这儿 从损害控制 局手里 救个无助的女孩，
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.27,1:52:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you came here
Dialogue: 2,1:52:20.36,1:52:23.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你来晚了。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:20.36,1:52:23.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}to save a helpless girl from Damage Control, you're too late.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:24.70,1:52:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}需要拯救的是他们。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:24.70,1:52:26.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They're the ones who need saving.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:26.57,1:52:27.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}现在……
Dialogue: 1,1:52:26.57,1:52:27.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And now...
Dialogue: 2,1:52:28.53,1:52:29.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你也一样。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:28.53,1:52:29.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}so do you.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:32.00,1:52:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}开始了。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:32.00,1:52:33.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Here we go.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:47.51,1:52:48.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}天啊，太酷了。
Dialogue: 1,1:52:47.51,1:52:48.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}God, that's cool.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:04.40,1:53:05.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哎哟！哎哟！
Dialogue: 1,1:53:04.40,1:53:05.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:10.03,1:53:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴！琴，求你了！
Dialogue: 1,1:53:10.03,1:53:12.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean! Jean, please!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:26.38,1:53:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快点！快点！快点！
Dialogue: 1,1:53:26.38,1:53:28.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:48.78,1:53:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么鬼……
Dialogue: 1,1:53:48.78,1:53:49.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What the...
Dialogue: 2,1:53:51.74,1:53:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你那帮损害控制局的朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.74,1:53:52.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Isn't it funny
Dialogue: 2,1:53:52.83,1:53:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}研发了件特殊武器不觉得挺有意思吗
Dialogue: 1,1:53:52.83,1:53:56.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}how your friends from Damage Control developed a special weapon
Dialogue: 2,1:53:56.37,1:53:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}只为你？
Dialogue: 1,1:53:56.37,1:53:57.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}just for you?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:58.92,1:54:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们备好了一整支特遣队。
Dialogue: 1,1:53:58.92,1:54:01.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They've got a whole task force ready.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:01.67,1:54:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}免得你哪天不安分。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:01.67,1:54:03.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just in case you ever get out of line.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:08.09,1:54:09.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}人都是怪物。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:08.09,1:54:09.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}People are monsters.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:14.43,1:54:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们信你多少，你最多信他们多少。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:14.43,1:54:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You shouldn't trust them any more than they trust you.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:31.24,1:54:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我正忙着呢，弗兰克。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:31.24,1:54:32.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm a little busy, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:32.49,1:54:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}小子，出麻烦了。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:32.49,1:54:33.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We got a problem, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:33.82,1:54:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她联系上了岛周围一公里内的所有人。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:33.82,1:54:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She got ahold of everyone within a kilometer of the island.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:36.70,1:54:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}等等，什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:54:36.70,1:54:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:44.29,1:54:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，听着， 你要做什 么，现在就赶紧做。
Dialogue: 1,1:54:44.29,1:54:46.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, look, if you're gonna do something, you better do it now.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:46.59,1:54:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我正努力呢！
Dialogue: 1,1:54:46.59,1:54:47.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:13.28,1:55:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-孩子？
Dialogue: 1,1:55:13.28,1:55:14.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Kid?
Dialogue: 2,1:55:14.78,1:55:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}妈的！该死！
Dialogue: 1,1:55:14.78,1:55:16.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shit! Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:50.40,1:55:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我妹妹死了
Dialogue: 1,1:55:50.40,1:55:51.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}My sister died
Dialogue: 2,1:55:51.70,1:55:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}在这间屋里，
Dialogue: 1,1:55:51.70,1:55:52.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}in this room,
Dialogue: 2,1:55:54.32,1:55:55.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}被这些男人包围。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:54.32,1:55:55.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}surrounded by these men.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:57.28,1:55:58.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她唯一的罪过
Dialogue: 1,1:55:57.28,1:55:58.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And her only crime
Dialogue: 2,1:55:58.54,1:56:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就是她很特别。
Dialogue: 1,1:55:58.54,1:56:00.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}was that she was special.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:01.20,1:56:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就跟你一样。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:01.20,1:56:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just like you.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:04.58,1:56:05.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就像我一样。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:04.58,1:56:05.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just like me.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:08.46,1:56:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}像我们这种人，过不了正常日子。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:08.46,1:56:11.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}People like us don't get to live a normal life.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:14.47,1:56:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们不能有朋友，也不能有家人。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:14.47,1:56:17.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We don't get to have friends or a family.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:19.64,1:56:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那些人都走了。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:19.64,1:56:21.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Those people are gone.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:23.85,1:56:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那样的生活结束了。
Dialogue: 1,1:56:23.85,1:56:25.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That life is over.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:51.71,1:56:54.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那你干嘛不对自己坦诚点？
Dialogue: 1,1:56:51.71,1:56:54.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}So why don't you just be honest with yourself?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:57.09,1:56:58.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你是彼得·帕克吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:56:57.09,1:56:58.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Are you Peter Parker?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:00.60,1:57:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还是说你是蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,1:57:00.60,1:57:01.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Or are you Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:34.96,1:57:35.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我两者都是。
Dialogue: 1,1:57:34.96,1:57:35.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm both.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:13.00,1:58:14.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 1,1:58:13.00,1:58:14.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}_
Dialogue: 2,1:59:20.78,1:59:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，求你了。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:20.78,1:59:22.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, please.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:24.12,1:59:25.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这样也弥补不了。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:24.12,1:59:25.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}This won't make it right.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:27.70,1:59:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}得了吧。你不是杀手，琴。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:27.70,1:59:29.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, come on. You're not a killer, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:29.66,1:59:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你根本不知道我是什么。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:29.66,1:59:30.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You have no idea what I am.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:32.71,1:59:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道你很爱你姐姐。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:32.71,1:59:34.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know that you loved your sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:37.67,1:59:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也知道，失去她 让 你觉得失去了一切。
Dialogue: 1,1:59:37.67,1:59:40.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I know that losing her felt like you'd lost everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:40.72,1:59:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你再靠近一步， 他就没命！ 他们全都 得死！
Dialogue: 1,1:59:40.72,1:59:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}If you come any closer, he dies! They all do!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:01.99,2:00:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道这样她也回不来吧，琴？
Dialogue: 1,2:00:01.99,2:00:03.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know this won't bring her back, right, Jean?
Dialogue: 2,2:00:03.57,2:00:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你……
Dialogue: 1,2:00:03.57,2:00:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You...
Dialogue: 2,2:00:21.21,2:00:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别太肯定我进不了你的脑子。
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.21,2:00:23.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't be so sure I can't get into your mind.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:25.51,2:00:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我比上次试时强多了。
Dialogue: 1,2:00:25.51,2:00:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm a lot more powerful since I last tried.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:37.90,2:00:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}继续吧。
Dialogue: 1,2:00:37.90,2:00:39.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:48.20,2:00:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,2:00:48.20,2:00:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:50.58,2:00:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,2:00:50.58,2:00:51.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:53.91,2:00:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你以为有了超能力， 就不用听我的了？
Dialogue: 1,2:00:53.91,2:00:57.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You think you don't have to listen to me now that you've got powers?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:02.26,2:01:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道，这……这整件事 可能会变得很吓人。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:02.26,2:01:07.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, this... this whole thing can get really scary.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:07.89,2:01:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:01:07.89,2:01:08.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know that?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:27.53,2:01:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}已经挺吓人了。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:27.53,2:01:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It's already pretty scary.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:30.53,2:01:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:30.53,2:01:31.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:32.04,2:01:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且事情也会变，
Dialogue: 1,2:01:32.04,2:01:33.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And things can change,
Dialogue: 2,2:01:33.50,2:01:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就是，特别快……
Dialogue: 1,2:01:33.50,2:01:35.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}like, very quickly...
Dialogue: 2,2:01:35.08,2:01:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……用我们现在想都想不到的方式。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:35.08,2:01:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}...in ways that we can't even imagine right now.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:38.17,2:01:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:38.17,2:01:39.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:39.33,2:01:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:39.33,2:01:40.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:43.09,2:01:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我看你根本就不知道。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:43.09,2:01:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I don't think you do know.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:46.63,2:01:48.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,2:01:46.63,2:01:48.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:51.35,2:01:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你真是个特别的人。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:51.35,2:01:53.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're a really special person.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:54.68,2:01:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我也希望，这能一直让 你 觉得自己特别棒，
Dialogue: 1,2:01:54.68,2:01:57.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And I would hope that that will always make you feel really great about yourself,
Dialogue: 2,2:01:58.69,2:02:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但我知道，有时候不会。
Dialogue: 1,2:01:58.69,2:02:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but I know sometimes it doesn't.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:01.61,2:02:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有时候，你会特别孤独。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:01.61,2:02:04.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Sometimes, you'll be really lonely.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:07.65,2:02:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而有时候，
Dialogue: 1,2:02:07.65,2:02:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And sometimes,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:10.20,2:02:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}因为你很特别，
Dialogue: 1,2:02:10.20,2:02:11.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}because you're special,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:14.12,2:02:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}人可能对你做出阴暗残暴的事。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:14.12,2:02:17.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}people can do dark, monstrous things to you.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:20.04,2:02:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可是……
Dialogue: 1,2:02:20.04,2:02:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But...
Dialogue: 2,2:02:22.67,2:02:24.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这就是我想让你知道的。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.67,2:02:24.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}this is what I want you to know.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:26.09,2:02:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你真美，
Dialogue: 1,2:02:26.09,2:02:27.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're beautiful,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:28.01,2:02:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}还有那些爱你的人，
Dialogue: 1,2:02:28.01,2:02:29.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}and the people who love you,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:29.55,2:02:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们爱你，不是因为你特别。 我们爱你，是因为你就是你。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:29.55,2:02:33.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}we love you not because you're special, we love you because you're you.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:35.52,2:02:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我要你记住这一点。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:35.52,2:02:36.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I want you to remember that.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:39.23,2:02:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哪怕你觉得自己孤身一人。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:39.23,2:02:41.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Even when it feels like you're totally alone.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:44.23,2:02:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那是你最重大的责任。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:44.23,2:02:46.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}That's your deepest responsibility.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:49.44,2:02:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不管你变得多强，都别忘了这一点。
Dialogue: 1,2:02:49.44,2:02:52.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Never forget that, no matter how powerful you become.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:08.92,2:03:10.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:08.92,2:03:10.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:25.73,2:03:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你姐姐的事，我很遗憾。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:25.73,2:03:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry about your sister.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:32.57,2:03:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你姑妈的事，我很难过。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:32.57,2:03:34.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry about your aunt.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:37.83,2:03:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，你肯定会喜欢她的。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:37.83,2:03:39.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, you would've loved her.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:42.92,2:03:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就因为我们失去了某个人……
Dialogue: 1,2:03:42.92,2:03:44.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just because we've lost someone...
Dialogue: 2,2:03:48.00,2:03:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这不代表我们得独自行动。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:48.00,2:03:50.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It doesn't mean we have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:52.05,2:03:54.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，我们不能。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:52.05,2:03:54.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, we can't.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:55.05,2:03:56.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}相信我，我一直在努力。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:55.05,2:03:56.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Trust me, I've been trying.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:59.93,2:04:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不管用。
Dialogue: 1,2:03:59.93,2:04:01.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:05.98,2:04:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}就算是真的……
Dialogue: 1,2:04:05.98,2:04:07.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Even if that's true...
Dialogue: 2,2:04:11.57,2:04:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我谁都没有。
Dialogue: 1,2:04:11.57,2:04:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I have no one.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:17.45,2:04:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}有我在。
Dialogue: 1,2:04:17.45,2:04:18.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You have me.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:55.66,2:04:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}[倒吸一口气，喘着粗气]
Dialogue: 1,2:04:55.66,2:04:57.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,2:05:03.16,2:05:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你受伤了吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:05:03.16,2:05:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:04.62,2:05:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}没事，我挺好的。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:04.62,2:05:06.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:11.63,2:05:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我没事。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:11.63,2:05:12.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:13.55,2:05:15.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}彼得。-我没事，我没事，我没事。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:13.55,2:05:15.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Peter.   -I'm okay, I'm okay, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:15.09,2:05:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}彼得。别。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:15.09,2:05:16.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Peter. No.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:20.30,2:05:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-彼得，彼得。不，不。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:20.30,2:05:22.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Peter, Peter. No, no.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:22.31,2:05:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}— 不，不，不，彼得。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:22.31,2:05:23.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}— No, no, no, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:23.64,2:05:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-彼得。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:23.64,2:05:25.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:25.39,2:05:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，你得离开这儿。 他们会找你的。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:25.39,2:05:27.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, you gotta get outta here. They'll be looking for you.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:27.90,2:05:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不，不，不， 不。 求你了， 别离开我。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:27.90,2:05:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, no, no, no, no. Please, just stay with me.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:29.69,2:05:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}快，撑住。快啊，求你了！
Dialogue: 1,2:05:29.69,2:05:30.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Come on, hold on. Come on, please!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:31.02,2:05:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴，你……
Dialogue: 1,2:05:31.02,2:05:32.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Jean, you're...
Dialogue: 2,2:05:33.07,2:05:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你会没事的。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:33.07,2:05:34.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:35.86,2:05:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}走吧。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:35.86,2:05:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just go.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:39.07,2:05:40.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看着我。
Dialogue: 1,2:05:39.07,2:05:40.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Look at me.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:57.84,2:05:59.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}今天，令人震惊，
Dialogue: 1,2:05:57.84,2:05:59.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Shock today,
Dialogue: 2,2:05:59.34,2:06:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠带着枪伤来到贝尔维尤医院时，
Dialogue: 1,2:05:59.34,2:06:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}as Spider-Man arrived at Bellevue Hospital with a bullet wound,
Dialogue: 2,2:06:03.22,2:06:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}看着快不行了。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:03.22,2:06:04.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}seemingly at death's door.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:07.10,2:06:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那位深居简出的打击犯罪者情况危急，
Dialogue: 1,2:06:07.10,2:06:09.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The reclusive crime fighter is in critical condition,
Dialogue: 2,2:06:09.81,2:06:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}此时，全市顶尖医疗专家正抢救他。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:09.81,2:06:12.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}as the city's top medical experts work to save him.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:16.28,2:06:19.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}今晚，所有人都在关注蜘蛛侠。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:16.28,2:06:19.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Tonight, all eyes are on Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:21.07,2:06:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那个多次拯救纽约的英雄……
Dialogue: 1,2:06:21.07,2:06:23.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}The hero who saved New York so many times...
Dialogue: 2,2:06:23.91,2:06:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}如今由最出色、最聪明的人掌管。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:23.91,2:06:26.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}is now in the hands of its best and brightest.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:28.87,2:06:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}纽约的人们也屏住了呼吸。
Dialogue: 1,2:06:28.87,2:06:31.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And the people of New York hold their breath.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:38.69,2:07:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}弗兰克？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:38.69,2:07:39.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Frank?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:43.16,2:07:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:43.16,2:07:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where am I?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:46.28,2:07:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，不，不，不， 不。嘿。 -我的面罩 呢？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:46.28,2:07:48.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No, no, no, no, no. Hey.   -Where's my mask?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:48.70,2:07:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}别担心，有我罩着你。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:48.70,2:07:50.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Don't worry about that. I got you covered.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:50.08,2:07:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，你挺厉害。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:50.08,2:07:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, you're good.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:51.62,2:07:53.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}琴在哪？她没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:51.62,2:07:53.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where's Jean? Is she okay?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:53.08,2:07:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，她没事。她没事。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:53.08,2:07:55.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, she's okay. She's okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:55.08,2:07:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她在哪儿？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:55.08,2:07:56.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:57.59,2:07:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想她可能就这么走了。
Dialogue: 1,2:07:57.59,2:07:59.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I think maybe she just left.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:00.42,2:08:05.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她，呃，用那破巫毒法术给你续命。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:00.42,2:08:05.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}She was, uh, using her magic voodoo shit to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:05.80,2:08:08.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯……她没事。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:05.80,2:08:08.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah... she's all right.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:15.48,2:08:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}对不起。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:15.48,2:08:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:21.36,2:08:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-弗兰克。  -就是…… 就是…… 我……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:21.36,2:08:22.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Frank.   -Just... Just... I'm...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:22.90,2:08:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-弗兰克，没事。  -我真的很抱歉，我做了那些事。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:22.90,2:08:24.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Frank, it's okay.   -I'm really sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:24.66,2:08:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-不，弗兰克，没事。而且这……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:24.66,2:08:25.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-No, Frank, it's okay. And it's...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:25.74,2:08:28.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，怎么形容都行， 但他妈的绝不能说没事， 懂吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:08:25.74,2:08:28.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No, it's a lot of things, but it sure as shit ain't okay, all right?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:32.04,2:08:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我见过……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:32.04,2:08:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've seen...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:34.87,2:08:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}孩子，我当年见识过真正的勇气。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:34.87,2:08:38.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've seen real bravery, kid, in my day.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:40.21,2:08:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可那……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:40.21,2:08:41.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}But that...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:42.67,2:08:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真是不一般。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:42.67,2:08:44.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}that was something else.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:47.51,2:08:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-你哭了，弗兰克？
Dialogue: 1,2:08:47.51,2:08:48.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-You crying, Frank?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:48.93,2:08:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，我不是……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:48.93,2:08:50.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. I ain't...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:57.19,2:08:59.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道吗，你长得跟我想的一模一样。
Dialogue: 1,2:08:57.19,2:08:59.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know, you look the exact way I thought you would.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:00.23,2:09:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你知道的。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:00.23,2:09:01.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You know.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:01.69,2:09:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}是个好孩子。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:01.69,2:09:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}A nice kid.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:05.36,2:09:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我从没交过这样的朋友。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:05.36,2:09:06.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Never had a friend like that.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:08.53,2:09:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我们现在算朋友了吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:09:08.53,2:09:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Are we friends now?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:17.04,2:09:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}真不敢相信，我刚看到你哭了。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:17.04,2:09:18.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I can't believe I just saw you cry.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:18.71,2:09:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}- 我没哭。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:18.71,2:09:19.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}- I didn't cry.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:19.84,2:09:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你在说什么？
Dialogue: 1,2:09:19.84,2:09:20.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:20.75,2:09:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}扯淡。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:20.75,2:09:22.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:24.22,2:09:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，对，这个。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:24.22,2:09:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, yeah, this.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:25.88,2:09:27.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}他们一整晚都在干这事。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:25.88,2:09:27.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They've been doing it all night.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:27.59,2:09:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你进来时，他们就在这 儿了。 看一眼吧。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:27.59,2:09:30.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}They've been here since you walked in. Just take a look.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:40.90,2:09:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，小子，你进来时， 他们只好把战衣剪开，
Dialogue: 1,2:09:40.90,2:09:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yo, kid, when you came in, they had to cut through the suit,
Dialogue: 2,2:09:43.94,2:09:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}但等你准备走的时候……
Dialogue: 1,2:09:43.94,2:09:46.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but when you're ready to split...
Dialogue: 2,2:09:46.86,2:09:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}……我有个计划。
Dialogue: 1,2:09:46.86,2:09:48.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}...I got a plan.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:10.30,2:10:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，是蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:10.30,2:10:13.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, it's Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:14.81,2:10:16.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:14.81,2:10:16.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:20.02,2:10:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:20.02,2:10:21.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:23.73,2:10:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}耶，蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:23.73,2:10:25.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:26.57,2:10:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你最棒了，蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:26.57,2:10:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You're the best, Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:29.40,2:10:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:29.40,2:10:30.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:32.41,2:10:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}这边！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:32.41,2:10:33.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Over here!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:34.58,2:10:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}谢谢！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:34.58,2:10:35.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Thank you!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:35.87,2:10:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:35.87,2:10:37.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:07.61,2:11:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:07.61,2:11:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man! Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:09.94,2:11:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:09.94,2:11:14.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:14.12,2:11:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:14.12,2:11:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:29.34,2:11:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:29.34,2:11:37.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:37.39,2:11:39.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠！蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:37.39,2:11:39.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man! Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:12:43.37,2:12:44.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我，呃……
Dialogue: 1,2:12:43.37,2:12:44.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I've, uh...
Dialogue: 2,2:12:47.38,2:12:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我一直在琢磨你说的话。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:47.38,2:12:49.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Been thinking a lot about what you said.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:51.88,2:12:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}而且你会很高兴知道 我决定不……
Dialogue: 1,2:12:51.88,2:12:54.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And you'd be happy to know that I've decided I'm not...
Dialogue: 2,2:12:56.26,2:12:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我不会再一个人做这事了。
Dialogue: 1,2:12:56.26,2:12:58.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm not gonna do this alone anymore.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:07.77,2:13:09.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我想你了，May。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:07.77,2:13:09.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I miss you, May.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:17.45,2:13:19.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，我背还是有点疼，
Dialogue: 1,2:13:17.45,2:13:19.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, I've still got a little pain in my back,
Dialogue: 2,2:13:19.53,2:13:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不过你要是需要我帮忙， 我应该还能再出马。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:19.53,2:13:22.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but I could probably get back out there if you need me for anything.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:22.58,2:13:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不，我要你好好休息。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:22.58,2:13:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. What I need you to do is rest.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:25.12,2:13:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我知道，我知道。 可拜托 了，你总得给我点什么吧。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:25.12,2:13:27.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I know, I know, but come on, you gotta give me something.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:27.25,2:13:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我是说，调查进展怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,2:13:27.25,2:13:29.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I mean, how's the investigation going?
Dialogue: 2,2:13:29.25,2:13:32.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，Metzger还是下落不明，
Dialogue: 1,2:13:29.25,2:13:32.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, Metzger's still missing,
Dialogue: 2,2:13:32.25,2:13:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}可你的朋友黑寡妇，
Dialogue: 1,2:13:32.25,2:13:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}but your friend, Black Widow,
Dialogue: 2,2:13:34.80,2:13:37.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}她一直在帮我们翻查所有记录
Dialogue: 1,2:13:34.80,2:13:37.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}she's been helping us dig through all the records
Dialogue: 2,2:13:37.51,2:13:39.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}损害控制局试图抹掉的。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:37.51,2:13:39.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Damage Control tried to have scrubbed.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:40.14,2:13:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}前几天她叫我去趟她办公室。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:40.14,2:13:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Had me drop by her office the other day.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:42.64,2:13:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}那怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,2:13:42.64,2:13:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}And how was that?
Dialogue: 2,2:13:44.14,2:13:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯，呃，我的皮肤感觉棒极了。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:44.14,2:13:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Well, uh, my skin feels amazing.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:48.27,2:13:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}各单位注意。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:48.27,2:13:49.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Attention, all units.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:49.56,2:13:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}已确认，有人正在抢银行。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:49.56,2:13:51.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}We have a confirmed bank robbery in progress.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:51.56,2:13:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}喂，你听得到吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:13:51.56,2:13:52.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, are you getting this?
Dialogue: 2,2:13:54.24,2:13:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好，我这就办。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:54.24,2:13:55.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:55.40,2:13:57.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嘿，离我这儿也不远。 我 应该能去那儿跟你碰面。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:55.40,2:13:57.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hey, it's not that far from me. I could probably meet you down there.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:57.82,2:14:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}不。抢劫我们应付得来。
Dialogue: 1,2:13:57.82,2:14:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}No. We can handle a robbery.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:01.20,2:14:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}尽量照顾好自己。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:01.20,2:14:03.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Just try to take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:05.66,2:14:06.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好的。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:05.66,2:14:06.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:08.00,2:14:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}你也是。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:08.00,2:14:09.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}You too.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:10.04,2:14:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}替我向EJ和Marley问好。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:10.04,2:14:11.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Say hello to EJ and Marley for me.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:12.17,2:14:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:12.17,2:14:14.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:16.17,2:14:17.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}蜘蛛侠向你问好。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:16.17,2:14:17.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Spider-Man says hello.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:53.84,2:14:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗨。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:53.84,2:14:54.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Hi.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:54.92,2:14:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}呃，嗨。
Dialogue: 1,2:14:54.92,2:14:56.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:58.38,2:15:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}哦，哦。呃，拿花的， 对吧？ 就是……就是派对上 那个？
Dialogue: 1,2:14:58.38,2:15:01.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Oh, oh. Uh, flower guy, right, from... from the party?
Dialogue: 2,2:15:01.68,2:15:02.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}嗯。
Dialogue: 1,2:15:01.68,2:15:02.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:03.39,2:15:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}我叫彼得。
Dialogue: 1,2:15:03.39,2:15:04.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}I'm Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:05.60,2:15:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}好。你好。
Dialogue: 1,2:15:05.60,2:15:06.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Okay. Hello.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:25.53,2:15:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}彼得。
Dialogue: 1,2:15:25.53,2:15:26.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:27.58,2:24:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}又有人目击蜘蛛侠。 地点不明。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:27.58,2:24:30.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}New Spider-Man sighting. Location unknown.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:31.75,2:24:33.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-位置不明。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:31.75,2:24:33.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Location unknown.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:34.54,2:24:36.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}位置不明。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:34.54,2:24:36.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Location unknown.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:37.21,2:24:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}位置不明。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:37.21,2:24:38.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Location unknown.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:39.96,2:24:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}位置不明。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:39.96,2:24:41.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}Location unknown.
Dialogue: 2,2:24:45.84,2:24:48.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur1.6}-找到位置了。
Dialogue: 1,2:24:45.84,2:24:48.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur1.6}-Location found.
